window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b054-4cafd8d0446693ad.json"]={sha256:"4cafd8d0446693ad6d4d0656549750afb63aebf9c4c0fb5cee49a034a6bfdf80",value:{"id":"b054","title":"預力混凝土孔道灌漿","titleEn":"Prestressing-duct grouting","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從 1985 年威爾斯 Ynys-y-Gwas 橋的突然崩塌與英國 1992 年暫停新建灌漿後拉橋的決定出發，說明灌漿如何同時提供防蝕與握裹，量化鋼腱斷絲的預力損失、高點泌水、氯離子含量與孔道面積比，再處理灌漿壓力與流速、錨頭封護與真空補灌、流度泌水與密度試驗、空洞非破壞檢測、硫酸鹽與氯離子劣化以及灌漿紀錄與風險分級，並以 2000 年夏洛特賽車場人行橋與倫敦漢默史密斯高架橋為鑑。","summaryEn":"Starting from the sudden 1985 collapse of the Ynys-y-Gwas bridge in Wales and Britain's 1992 halt on new grouted post-tensioned bridges, explain how grout provides both corrosion protection and bond, quantify force loss from broken strands, bleed at high points, chloride content and duct area ratio, then cover grouting pressure and rate, anchorage protection and vacuum regrouting, fluidity, bleed and density testing, non-destructive void detection, sulfate and chloride deterioration and grouting records and risk ranking, learning from the 2000 Charlotte Motor Speedway footbridge and London's Hammersmith Flyover.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁耐久、檢測與健康監測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge durability, inspection and health monitoring","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-durability-monitoring","concrete"],"architectureFamily":"concrete","architectureNodes":[["鋼腱線形與孔道","Tendon profile and duct"],["灌漿材料與配比","Grout material and mix"],["灌漿口、排氣與錨頭","Inlets, vents and anchorages"],["灌漿程序與試驗","Grouting procedure and tests"],["空洞檢測與補灌","Void detection and regrouting"],["灌漿紀錄與風險分級","Grouting records and risk ranking"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,2],[1,3],[2,3],[3,4],[3,5],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"concrete","labels":["鋼腱線形與孔道","灌漿材料與配比","灌漿口、排氣與錨頭","灌漿程序與試驗","空洞檢測與補灌"],"labelsEn":["Tendon profile and duct","Grout material and mix","Inlets, vents and anchorages","Grouting procedure and tests","Void detection and regrouting"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：一條 100 m 長、19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線的連續梁鋼腱（A_ps = 2,660 mm²，有效應力 1,100 MPa，P_e ≈ 2.93 MN），孔道內徑 100 mm，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95，理論淨灌漿量 5,194 mm²×100 m ≈ 0.52 m³。以 30 L/min 灌注，推進速度約 5.8 m/min、需時約 17 分鐘；墩頂高點高出灌漿口 3 m，靜水壓約 56 kPa。灌漿 w/c = 0.40、水泥比重 3.15，理論密度約 1.95 kg/L，若出口量得 1.89 kg/L，代表 w/c 約 0.45、可能加水，應退料。拌合水氯離子 500 mg/L 帶入 0.02%，材料 0.05%，合計 0.07% 低於 0.08%。完工對帳實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 30 L，約 5.8 m 孔道體積；以波以耳法量測高點空洞約 5.7 L 並真空補灌。若此鋼腱因空洞腐蝕斷 3 股，預力損失約 16%（0.46 MN）。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際橋梁或產品的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: a 100 m continuous-girder tendon of 19 strands of 15.2 mm (A_ps = 2,660 mm², effective stress 1,100 MPa, P_e ≈ 2.93 MN) sits in a 100 mm duct with an area ratio of 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95 and a theoretical net grout volume of 5,194 mm²×100 m ≈ 0.52 m³. Pumping at 30 L/min advances about 5.8 m/min and takes about 17 minutes; the pier crest is 3 m above the inlet, a static head of about 56 kPa. With w/c = 0.40 and cement specific gravity 3.15 the theoretical density is about 1.95 kg/L; an outlet reading of 1.89 kg/L implies w/c of about 0.45, probably added water, so the batch is rejected. Mixing water at 500 mg/L chloride adds 0.02% and the material 0.05%, 0.07% in total, below 0.08%. Reconciliation shows 0.49 m³ injected, a 30 L shortfall equal to about 5.8 m of duct; Boyle's-law measurement finds a crest void of about 5.7 L, which is vacuum regrouted. If the tendon later lost 3 strands to corrosion in a void, the force loss would be about 16% (0.46 MN). Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real bridge or product.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b054-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果」與「鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion\" and \"Tendon profile, high points and void formation\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b054-v13-01","title":"灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tendon effective force P_e” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"後拉預力鋼腱在張拉錨定後，孔道內必須以水泥系灌漿完全填滿：灌漿的高鹼性使鋼絞線表面鈍化而不鏽蝕，硬化後又把鋼腱與周圍混凝土握裹在一起，使預力不再只依賴兩端錨頭，局部斷絲時力量也能在短距離內重新傳回混凝土。一旦孔道留下空洞、泌水或灌漿受氯離子汙染，鋼絞線在看不見的地方腐蝕，強度高、斷面小的鋼絲對蝕坑特別敏感，可能在沒有明顯預兆下斷裂。威爾斯 1953 年建成的 Ynys-y-Gwas 單跨預鑄節塊後拉橋，就因節塊間現澆接縫處保護不足的鋼腱腐蝕，在 1985 年突然崩塌。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After a post-tensioning tendon is stressed and anchored, its duct must be completely filled with cementitious grout: the grout's high alkalinity passivates the strand surface against rusting, and once hardened it bonds tendon to concrete so the prestress no longer depends only on the end anchorages and a local wire break can re-transfer force to the concrete within a short length. Voids, bleed water or chloride-contaminated grout let strands corrode out of sight, and high-strength wires with small sections are especially sensitive to pits, so they can fracture without obvious warning. The single-span precast segmental Ynys-y-Gwas bridge in Wales, built in 1953, collapsed suddenly in 1985 because tendons corroded at the in-situ joints between segments, where they were inadequately protected. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Tendon effective force P_e” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線，每股 140 mm²，A_ps = 2,660 mm²；有效應力 1,100 MPa 時 P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 19-strand tendon of 15.2 mm strand at 140 mm² each has A_ps = 2,660 mm²; at an effective stress of 1,100 MPa, P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN.","failure":"常見誤解：「鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Tendon effective force P_e”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-01-k1","title":"灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果","titleEn":"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion","text":"後拉預力鋼腱在張拉錨定後，孔道內必須以水泥系灌漿完全填滿：灌漿的高鹼性使鋼絞線表面鈍化而不鏽蝕，硬化後又把鋼腱與周圍混凝土握裹在一起，使預力不再只依賴兩端錨頭，局部斷絲時力量也能在短距離內重新傳回混凝土。一旦孔道留下空洞、泌水或灌漿受氯離子汙染，鋼絞線在看不見的地方腐蝕，強度高、斷面小的鋼絲對蝕坑特別敏感，可能在沒有明顯預兆下斷裂。","textEn":"After a post-tensioning tendon is stressed and anchored, its duct must be completely filled with cementitious grout: the grout's high alkalinity passivates the strand surface against rusting, and once hardened it bonds tendon to concrete so the prestress no longer depends only on the end anchorages and a local wire break can re-transfer force to the concrete within a short length. Voids, bleed water or chloride-contaminated grout let strands corrode out of sight, and high-strength wires with small sections are especially sensitive to pits, so they can fracture without obvious warning.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion\" is correct?","options":["鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。","後拉預力鋼腱在張拉錨定後，孔道內必須以水泥系灌漿完全填滿：灌漿的高鹼性使鋼絞線表面鈍化而不鏽蝕，硬化後又把鋼腱與周圍混凝土握裹在一起，使預力不再只依賴兩端錨頭，局部斷絲時力量也能在短距離內重新傳回混凝土。","灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。"],"optionsEn":["Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust.","After a post-tensioning tendon is stressed and anchored, its duct must be completely filled with cementitious grout: the grout's high alkalinity passivates the strand surface against rusting, and once hardened it bonds tendon to concrete so the prestress no longer depends only on the end anchorages and a local wire break can re-transfer force to the concrete within a short length.","If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled."],"answer":1,"explanation":"後拉預力鋼腱在張拉錨定後，孔道內必須以水泥系灌漿完全填滿：灌漿的高鹼性使鋼絞線表面鈍化而不鏽蝕，硬化後又把鋼腱與周圍混凝土握裹在一起，使預力不再只依賴兩端錨頭，局部斷絲時力量也能在短距離內重新傳回混凝土。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After a post-tensioning tendon is stressed and anchored, its duct must be completely filled with cementitious grout: the grout's high alkalinity passivates the strand surface against rusting, and once hardened it bonds tendon to concrete so the prestress no longer depends only on the end anchorages and a local wire break can re-transfer force to the concrete within a short length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b054-v13-02","title":"灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果：定量估算","titleEn":"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tendon effective force P_e” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線，每股 140 mm²，A_ps = 2,660 mm²；有效應力 1,100 MPa 時 P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN。若腐蝕使 3 股斷裂，預力損失 3/19 ≈ 16%，約 0.46 MN；斷絲集中在同一斷面時，該處彎曲強度與裂縫控制同步下降。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 19-strand tendon of 15.2 mm strand at 140 mm² each has A_ps = 2,660 mm²; at an effective stress of 1,100 MPa, P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN. If corrosion breaks 3 strands, the force loss is 3/19 ≈ 16%, about 0.46 MN; with breaks concentrated at one section, flexural strength and crack control fall together there. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以設計圖整理每條鋼腱的股數、有效預力、線形與錨頭位置，標示節塊接縫、耦合器與高點等易腐蝕位置；檢查計畫優先抽查這些位置，並以結構分析評估單一鋼腱失去部分或全部預力時的剩餘承載。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: From the design drawings tabulate each tendon's strand count, effective force, profile and anchorage locations, marking corrosion-prone points such as segment joints, couplers and high points; prioritise them in inspection and assess by structural analysis the remaining capacity if one tendon loses part or all of its force.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線，每股 140 mm²，A_ps = 2,660 mm²；有效應力 1,100 MPa 時 P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN。若腐蝕使 3 股斷裂，預力損失 3/19 ≈ 16%，約 0.46 MN；斷絲集中在同一斷面時，該處彎曲強度與裂縫控制同步下降。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A 19-strand tendon of 15.2 mm strand at 140 mm² each has A_ps = 2,660 mm²; at an effective stress of 1,100 MPa, P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN. If corrosion breaks 3 strands, the force loss is 3/19 ≈ 16%, about 0.46 MN; with breaks concentrated at one section, flexural strength and crack control fall together there. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion\", which statement holds?","options":["孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。","灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線，每股 140 mm²，A_ps = 2,660 mm²。"],"optionsEn":["A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter.","If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","A 19-strand tendon of 15.2 mm strand at 140 mm² each has A_ps = 2,660 mm²; at an effective stress of 1,100 MPa, P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN."],"answer":2,"explanation":"19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線，每股 140 mm²，A_ps = 2,660 mm²；有效應力 1,100 MPa 時 P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 19-strand tendon of 15.2 mm strand at 140 mm² each has A_ps = 2,660 mm²; at an effective stress of 1,100 MPa, P_e = 2,660×1,100 ≈ 2.93 MN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b054-v13-03","title":"灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tendon effective force P_e” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以設計圖整理每條鋼腱的股數、有效預力、線形與錨頭位置，標示節塊接縫、耦合器與高點等易腐蝕位置；檢查計畫優先抽查這些位置，並以結構分析評估單一鋼腱失去部分或全部預力時的剩餘承載。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"From the design drawings tabulate each tendon's strand count, effective force, profile and anchorage locations, marking corrosion-prone points such as segment joints, couplers and high points; prioritise them in inspection and assess by structural analysis the remaining capacity if one tendon loses part or all of its force. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計階段就把節塊接縫、耦合器與錨頭列為防蝕重點，採用多層保護（密封塑膠孔道、完整灌漿、錨頭封蓋與防水），並在圖面上標示每條鋼腱的灌漿與排氣口位置。","observationEn":"Site practice: At design make segment joints, couplers and anchorages corrosion-protection priorities with multilayer protection (sealed plastic ducts, complete grouting, anchorage caps and waterproofing), and show every tendon's grout inlets and vents on the drawings.","failure":"注意干擾：Ynys-y-Gwas 橋崩塌前外觀沒有明顯警訊；鋼腱在接縫處腐蝕斷裂，結構在沒有超載的情況下突然倒塌。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: The Ynys-y-Gwas bridge showed no obvious warning before it fell; tendons corroded through at the joints and the structure collapsed suddenly without overload. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以設計圖整理每條鋼腱的股數、有效預力、線形與錨頭位置，標示節塊接縫、耦合器與高點等易腐蝕位置；檢查計畫優先抽查這些位置，並以結構分析評估單一鋼腱失去部分或全部預力時的剩餘承載。","textEn":"From the design drawings tabulate each tendon's strand count, effective force, profile and anchorage locations, marking corrosion-prone points such as segment joints, couplers and high points; prioritise them in inspection and assess by structural analysis the remaining capacity if one tendon loses part or all of its force.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計階段就把節塊接縫、耦合器與錨頭列為防蝕重點，採用多層保護（密封塑膠孔道、完整灌漿、錨頭封蓋與防水），並在圖面上標示每條鋼腱的灌漿與排氣口位置。","textEn":"At design make segment joints, couplers and anchorages corrosion-protection priorities with multilayer protection (sealed plastic ducts, complete grouting, anchorage caps and waterproofing), and show every tendon's grout inlets and vents on the drawings.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion\"?","options":["以設計圖整理每條鋼腱的股數、有效預力、線形與錨頭位置，標示節塊接縫、耦合器與高點等易腐蝕位置。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。"],"optionsEn":["From the design drawings tabulate each tendon's strand count, effective force, profile and anchorage locations, marking corrosion-prone points such as segment joints, couplers and high points.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以設計圖整理每條鋼腱的股數、有效預力、線形與錨頭位置，標示節塊接縫、耦合器與高點等易腐蝕位置；檢查計畫優先抽查這些位置，並以結構分析評估單一鋼腱失去部分或全部預力時的剩餘承載。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"From the design drawings tabulate each tendon's strand count, effective force, profile and anchorage locations, marking corrosion-prone points such as segment joints, couplers and high points; prioritise them in inspection and assess by structural analysis the remaining capacity if one tendon loses part or all of its force. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b054-v13-04","title":"灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果：失效診斷","titleEn":"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鋼腱有效預力 P_e」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tendon effective force P_e” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"Ynys-y-Gwas 橋崩塌前外觀沒有明顯警訊；鋼腱在接縫處腐蝕斷裂，結構在沒有超載的情況下突然倒塌。這類破壞的特徵正是灌漿缺陷與鋼腱腐蝕都藏在混凝土內，日常目視檢查難以發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"The Ynys-y-Gwas bridge showed no obvious warning before it fell; tendons corroded through at the joints and the structure collapsed suddenly without overload. The hallmark of such failures is that both grout defects and tendon corrosion are hidden inside the concrete, beyond routine visual inspection. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：威爾斯 1953 年建成的 Ynys-y-Gwas 單跨預鑄節塊後拉橋，就因節塊間現澆接縫處保護不足的鋼腱腐蝕，在 1985 年突然崩塌。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The single-span precast segmental Ynys-y-Gwas bridge in Wales, built in 1953, collapsed suddenly in 1985 because tendons corroded at the in-situ joints between segments, where they were inadequately protected.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"Ynys-y-Gwas 橋崩塌前外觀沒有明顯警訊；鋼腱在接縫處腐蝕斷裂，結構在沒有超載的情況下突然倒塌。這類破壞的特徵正是灌漿缺陷與鋼腱腐蝕都藏在混凝土內，日常目視檢查難以發現。","textEn":"The Ynys-y-Gwas bridge showed no obvious warning before it fell; tendons corroded through at the joints and the structure collapsed suddenly without overload. The hallmark of such failures is that both grout defects and tendon corrosion are hidden inside the concrete, beyond routine visual inspection.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿的功能與鋼腱腐蝕後果」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"What grout does and the consequences of tendon corrosion\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","Ynys-y-Gwas 橋崩塌前外觀沒有明顯警訊；鋼腱在接縫處腐蝕斷裂，結構在沒有超載的情況下突然倒塌。","灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","The Ynys-y-Gwas bridge showed no obvious warning before it fell; tendons corroded through at the joints and the structure collapsed suddenly without overload.","If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Ynys-y-Gwas 橋崩塌前外觀沒有明顯警訊；鋼腱在接縫處腐蝕斷裂，結構在沒有超載的情況下突然倒塌。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"The Ynys-y-Gwas bridge showed no obvious warning before it fell; tendons corroded through at the joints and the structure collapsed suddenly without overload. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b054-v13-05","title":"鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Tendon profile, high points and void formation: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「高點泌水層」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bleed-water lens at high points” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"連續梁的鋼腱線形在墩頂向上彎、在跨中向下彎，灌漿沿孔道流動時，空氣與泌水會往高點聚集；鋼絞線束在孔道內形成細小通道，會像燈芯一樣把水往上吸，使高點與錨頭附近更容易留下水層與空洞。水分之後被吸收或蒸發，留下的就是空洞，而鋼絞線正好暴露在潮濕空氣中。FHWA 的研究指出，美國在 1999 年起陸續發現的鋼腱耐久問題，多與灌漿空洞、泌水以及錨頭與高點處的鋼絞線腐蝕有關。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「高點泌水層」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A continuous girder's tendon rises over the piers and dips at midspan; as grout flows along the duct, air and bleed water collect at high points, and the strand bundle forms fine channels that wick water upward like a lamp wick, so water lenses and voids are more likely at crests and near anchorages. The water is later absorbed or evaporates, leaving a void with strands exposed to damp air. FHWA research notes that the tendon durability problems found in the United States from 1999 onward were associated with grout voids, bleed water and strand corrosion at anchorages and crests. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Bleed-water lens at high points” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：高點泌水層厚度 ≈ 泌水率 × 灌漿柱高。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: High-point bleed lens thickness ≈ bleed fraction × grout column height.","failure":"常見誤解：「灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「高點泌水層」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Bleed-water lens at high points”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-05-k1","title":"鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成","titleEn":"Tendon profile, high points and void formation","text":"連續梁的鋼腱線形在墩頂向上彎、在跨中向下彎，灌漿沿孔道流動時，空氣與泌水會往高點聚集；鋼絞線束在孔道內形成細小通道，會像燈芯一樣把水往上吸，使高點與錨頭附近更容易留下水層與空洞。水分之後被吸收或蒸發，留下的就是空洞，而鋼絞線正好暴露在潮濕空氣中。","textEn":"A continuous girder's tendon rises over the piers and dips at midspan; as grout flows along the duct, air and bleed water collect at high points, and the strand bundle forms fine channels that wick water upward like a lamp wick, so water lenses and voids are more likely at crests and near anchorages. The water is later absorbed or evaporates, leaving a void with strands exposed to damp air.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Tendon profile, high points and void formation\" is correct?","options":["灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。","加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。","連續梁的鋼腱線形在墩頂向上彎、在跨中向下彎，灌漿沿孔道流動時，空氣與泌水會往高點聚集。"],"optionsEn":["If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled.","Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.","A continuous girder's tendon rises over the piers and dips at midspan."],"answer":2,"explanation":"連續梁的鋼腱線形在墩頂向上彎、在跨中向下彎，灌漿沿孔道流動時，空氣與泌水會往高點聚集；鋼絞線束在孔道內形成細小通道，會像燈芯一樣把水往上吸，使高點與錨頭附近更容易留下水層與空洞。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A continuous girder's tendon rises over the piers and dips at midspan; as grout flows along the duct, air and bleed water collect at high points, and the strand bundle forms fine channels that wick water upward like a lamp wick, so water lenses and voids are more likely at crests and near anchorages. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b054-v13-06","title":"鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成：定量估算","titleEn":"Tendon profile, high points and void formation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高點泌水層」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bleed-water lens at high points” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：高點泌水層厚度 ≈ 泌水率 × 灌漿柱高。墩頂高點比相鄰低點高 2.0 m，灌漿泌水率 2% 時水層約 0.02×2,000 = 40 mm，足以淹沒孔道頂部的鋼絞線；泌水率 0% 的觸變性灌漿理論上不形成水層。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: High-point bleed lens thickness ≈ bleed fraction × grout column height. With a crest 2.0 m above the adjacent low point and 2% bleed, the lens is about 0.02×2,000 = 40 mm, enough to cover strands at the top of the duct; a thixotropic grout with 0% bleed theoretically forms no lens. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：依鋼腱線形圖逐條標出高點、低點與錨頭，確認每個高點都有排氣管、低點有灌漿口或排水口；以灌漿試驗中的泌水結果檢查材料在實際高差下是否會形成水層，必要時以實尺寸模擬孔道試灌。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Mark high points, low points and anchorages on each tendon profile, confirming every crest has a vent and every low point an inlet or drain; check bleed results from grout tests against the actual height differences, and if needed trial-grout a full-scale mock-up duct.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"高點泌水層厚度 ≈ 泌水率 × 灌漿柱高。墩頂高點比相鄰低點高 2.0 m，灌漿泌水率 2% 時水層約 0.02×2,000 = 40 mm，足以淹沒孔道頂部的鋼絞線；泌水率 0% 的觸變性灌漿理論上不形成水層。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"High-point bleed lens thickness ≈ bleed fraction × grout column height. With a crest 2.0 m above the adjacent low point and 2% bleed, the lens is about 0.02×2,000 = 40 mm, enough to cover strands at the top of the duct; a thixotropic grout with 0% bleed theoretically forms no lens. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Tendon profile, high points and void formation\", which statement holds?","options":["高點泌水層厚度 ≈ 泌水率 × 灌漿柱高。","灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。","灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["High-point bleed lens thickness ≈ bleed fraction × grout column height.","The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely.","The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"高點泌水層厚度 ≈ 泌水率 × 灌漿柱高。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"High-point bleed lens thickness ≈ bleed fraction × grout column height. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b054-v13-07","title":"鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Tendon profile, high points and void formation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「高點泌水層」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Bleed-water lens at high points” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"依鋼腱線形圖逐條標出高點、低點與錨頭，確認每個高點都有排氣管、低點有灌漿口或排水口；以灌漿試驗中的泌水結果檢查材料在實際高差下是否會形成水層，必要時以實尺寸模擬孔道試灌。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Mark high points, low points and anchorages on each tendon profile, confirming every crest has a vent and every low point an inlet or drain; check bleed results from grout tests against the actual height differences, and if needed trial-grout a full-scale mock-up duct. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：孔道配置圖要列出每個高點、低點與錨頭的排氣或灌漿口，並規定高點排氣管延伸到高於孔道的位置以便觀察；施工前由設計者與專業承包商共同確認配置。","observationEn":"Site practice: The duct layout drawing lists the vent or inlet at every crest, low point and anchorage and requires crest vents to rise above the duct for observation; the designer and the specialist contractor confirm the layout together before construction.","failure":"注意干擾：只在兩端錨頭設灌漿口與出漿口而高點沒有排氣管，空氣被困在墩頂高點；或使用泌水率高的配比，泌水沿鋼絞線集中到高點與錨頭，數年後這些位置的鋼絞線先腐蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Providing grout ports only at the two anchorages with no vent at the crest traps air over the pier; a high-bleed mix lets water migrate along the strands to crests and anchorages, where strands corrode first within a few years. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依鋼腱線形圖逐條標出高點、低點與錨頭，確認每個高點都有排氣管、低點有灌漿口或排水口；以灌漿試驗中的泌水結果檢查材料在實際高差下是否會形成水層，必要時以實尺寸模擬孔道試灌。","textEn":"Mark high points, low points and anchorages on each tendon profile, confirming every crest has a vent and every low point an inlet or drain; check bleed results from grout tests against the actual height differences, and if needed trial-grout a full-scale mock-up duct.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"孔道配置圖要列出每個高點、低點與錨頭的排氣或灌漿口，並規定高點排氣管延伸到高於孔道的位置以便觀察；施工前由設計者與專業承包商共同確認配置。","textEn":"The duct layout drawing lists the vent or inlet at every crest, low point and anchorage and requires crest vents to rise above the duct for observation; the designer and the specialist contractor confirm the layout together before construction.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Tendon profile, high points and void formation\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","依鋼腱線形圖逐條標出高點、低點與錨頭，確認每個高點都有排氣管、低點有灌漿口或排水口。","使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Mark high points, low points and anchorages on each tendon profile, confirming every crest has a vent and every low point an inlet or drain.","New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依鋼腱線形圖逐條標出高點、低點與錨頭，確認每個高點都有排氣管、低點有灌漿口或排水口；以灌漿試驗中的泌水結果檢查材料在實際高差下是否會形成水層，必要時以實尺寸模擬孔道試灌。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Mark high points, low points and anchorages on each tendon profile, confirming every crest has a vent and every low point an inlet or drain; check bleed results from grout tests against the actual height differences, and if needed trial-grout a full-scale mock-up duct. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b054-v13-08","title":"鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成：失效診斷","titleEn":"Tendon profile, high points and void formation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高點泌水層」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Bleed-water lens at high points” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只在兩端錨頭設灌漿口與出漿口而高點沒有排氣管，空氣被困在墩頂高點；或使用泌水率高的配比，泌水沿鋼絞線集中到高點與錨頭，數年後這些位置的鋼絞線先腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Providing grout ports only at the two anchorages with no vent at the crest traps air over the pier; a high-bleed mix lets water migrate along the strands to crests and anchorages, where strands corrode first within a few years. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：FHWA 的研究指出，美國在 1999 年起陸續發現的鋼腱耐久問題，多與灌漿空洞、泌水以及錨頭與高點處的鋼絞線腐蝕有關。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: FHWA research notes that the tendon durability problems found in the United States from 1999 onward were associated with grout voids, bleed water and strand corrosion at anchorages and crests.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在兩端錨頭設灌漿口與出漿口而高點沒有排氣管，空氣被困在墩頂高點；或使用泌水率高的配比，泌水沿鋼絞線集中到高點與錨頭，數年後這些位置的鋼絞線先腐蝕。","textEn":"Providing grout ports only at the two anchorages with no vent at the crest traps air over the pier; a high-bleed mix lets water migrate along the strands to crests and anchorages, where strands corrode first within a few years.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鋼腱線形、高點與空洞形成」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Tendon profile, high points and void formation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。","只在兩端錨頭設灌漿口與出漿口而高點沒有排氣管，空氣被困在墩頂高點；或使用泌水率高的配比，泌水沿鋼絞線集中到高點與錨頭，數年後這些位置的鋼絞線先腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.","Providing grout ports only at the two anchorages with no vent at the crest traps air over the pier."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只在兩端錨頭設灌漿口與出漿口而高點沒有排氣管，空氣被困在墩頂高點；或使用泌水率高的配比，泌水沿鋼絞線集中到高點與錨頭，數年後這些位置的鋼絞線先腐蝕。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Providing grout ports only at the two anchorages with no vent at the crest traps air over the pier; a high-bleed mix lets water migrate along the strands to crests and anchorages, where strands corrode first within a few years. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b054-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制」與「孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control\" and \"Ducts, ports and anchorage details\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b054-v13-09","title":"灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Grout class and chloride limit” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"現代後拉灌漿多採工廠預拌包裝的材料，美國 PTI M55.1 把灌漿分為 A 至 D 四級（A 非侵蝕環境、B 侵蝕環境、C 預拌產品適用兩者、D 由工程師決定），規定水泥種類、礦物摻料與最大水膠比 0.45，並禁止使用緻密化矽灰。灌漿中的氯離子與硫酸鹽會破壞鋼材鈍化膜，美國 PTI、ACI 與 AASHTO 以水泥重量 0.08% 作為酸溶性氯離子上限，歐洲標準則為 0.10%。2001 年後預拌觸變性灌漿普及，但 FHWA 調查顯示部分新橋仍因材料離析、軟化與高氯、高硫酸鹽而腐蝕，說明材料管理與現場拌合同樣重要。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Modern post-tensioning grouts are mostly factory pre-bagged; PTI M55.1 in the United States defines classes A to D (A for non-aggressive, B for aggressive, C pre-bagged for either, D as specified by the engineer), sets cement types, supplementary materials and a maximum water-to-cementitious ratio of 0.45, and prohibits densified silica fume. Chlorides and sulfates in grout break down the steel's passive film, and PTI, ACI and AASHTO limit acid-soluble chloride to 0.08% by weight of cement, while the European standard uses 0.10%. Pre-bagged thixotropic grouts spread after 2001, yet FHWA investigations found some newer bridges still corroding because of segregated, soft grout with high chloride and sulfate, showing that material control matters as much as field mixing. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Grout class and chloride limit” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：拌合水帶入的氯離子 = 水灰比 × 水中氯離子濃度。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Chloride from mixing water = water–cement ratio × chloride concentration.","failure":"常見誤解：「加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Grout class and chloride limit”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-09-k1","title":"灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制","titleEn":"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control","text":"現代後拉灌漿多採工廠預拌包裝的材料，美國 PTI M55.1 把灌漿分為 A 至 D 四級（A 非侵蝕環境、B 侵蝕環境、C 預拌產品適用兩者、D 由工程師決定），規定水泥種類、礦物摻料與最大水膠比 0.45，並禁止使用緻密化矽灰。灌漿中的氯離子與硫酸鹽會破壞鋼材鈍化膜，美國 PTI、ACI 與 AASHTO 以水泥重量 0.08% 作為酸溶性氯離子上限，歐洲標準則為 0.10%。","textEn":"Modern post-tensioning grouts are mostly factory pre-bagged; PTI M55.1 in the United States defines classes A to D (A for non-aggressive, B for aggressive, C pre-bagged for either, D as specified by the engineer), sets cement types, supplementary materials and a maximum water-to-cementitious ratio of 0.45, and prohibits densified silica fume. Chlorides and sulfates in grout break down the steel's passive film, and PTI, ACI and AASHTO limit acid-soluble chloride to 0.08% by weight of cement, while the European standard uses 0.10%.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control\" is correct?","options":["現代後拉灌漿多採工廠預拌包裝的材料，美國 PTI M55.1 把灌漿分為 A 至 D 四級（A 非侵蝕環境、B 侵蝕環境、C 預拌產品適用兩者、D 由工程師決定），規定水泥種類、礦物摻料與最大水膠比 0.45，並禁止使用緻密化矽灰。","加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。","孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Modern post-tensioning grouts are mostly factory pre-bagged.","Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.","A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"現代後拉灌漿多採工廠預拌包裝的材料，美國 PTI M55.1 把灌漿分為 A 至 D 四級（A 非侵蝕環境、B 侵蝕環境、C 預拌產品適用兩者、D 由工程師決定），規定水泥種類、礦物摻料與最大水膠比 0.45，並禁止使用緻密化矽灰。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Modern post-tensioning grouts are mostly factory pre-bagged; PTI M55.1 in the United States defines classes A to D (A for non-aggressive, B for aggressive, C pre-bagged for either, D as specified by the engineer), sets cement types, supplementary materials and a maximum water-to-cementitious ratio of 0.45, and prohibits densified silica fume. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b054-v13-10","title":"灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Grout class and chloride limit” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：拌合水帶入的氯離子 = 水灰比 × 水中氯離子濃度。w/c = 0.40、拌合水含 500 mg/L：每 kg 水泥帶入 0.40×500 = 200 mg，即 0.02%，加上材料本身 0.05% 共 0.07%，低於 0.08%；若誤用海水（約 19,000 mg/L），單由水帶入 0.76%，遠超上限。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Chloride from mixing water = water–cement ratio × chloride concentration. With w/c = 0.40 and 500 mg/L in the water, each kg of cement receives 0.40×500 = 200 mg, i.e. 0.02%, which with 0.05% from the material totals 0.07%, below 0.08%; seawater at about 19,000 mg/L would contribute 0.76% from the water alone, far above the limit. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：審查灌漿產品的型式試驗報告（流度、泌水、凝結時間、強度、氯離子與硫酸鹽含量）與批號；現場確認包裝未受潮、未過期、儲存條件合格，拌合水來源經水質檢驗，並保留每批材料的出廠證明。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Review the grout product's qualification reports (fluidity, bleed, setting time, strength, chloride and sulfate content) and batch numbers; on site confirm bags are dry, in date and properly stored, that mixing water is tested and that mill certificates are kept for every lot.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"拌合水帶入的氯離子 = 水灰比 × 水中氯離子濃度。w/c = 0.40、拌合水含 500 mg/L：每 kg 水泥帶入 0.40×500 = 200 mg，即 0.02%，加上材料本身 0.05% 共 0.07%，低於 0.08%；若誤用海水（約 19,000 mg/L），單由水帶入 0.76%，遠超上限。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Chloride from mixing water = water–cement ratio × chloride concentration. With w/c = 0.40 and 500 mg/L in the water, each kg of cement receives 0.40×500 = 200 mg, i.e. 0.02%, which with 0.05% from the material totals 0.07%, below 0.08%; seawater at about 19,000 mg/L would contribute 0.76% from the water alone, far above the limit. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control\", which statement holds?","options":["灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","拌合水帶入的氯離子 = 水灰比 × 水中氯離子濃度。","非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。"],"optionsEn":["If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","Chloride from mixing water = water–cement ratio × chloride concentration.","Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty."],"answer":1,"explanation":"拌合水帶入的氯離子 = 水灰比 × 水中氯離子濃度。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Chloride from mixing water = water–cement ratio × chloride concentration. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b054-v13-11","title":"灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Grout class and chloride limit” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"審查灌漿產品的型式試驗報告（流度、泌水、凝結時間、強度、氯離子與硫酸鹽含量）與批號；現場確認包裝未受潮、未過期、儲存條件合格，拌合水來源經水質檢驗，並保留每批材料的出廠證明。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Review the grout product's qualification reports (fluidity, bleed, setting time, strength, chloride and sulfate content) and batch numbers; on site confirm bags are dry, in date and properly stored, that mixing water is tested and that mill certificates are kept for every lot. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規格書明定灌漿等級、核可產品與禁止事項（禁止現場添加任何未經核准的外加劑、禁止使用含氯材料），任何材料替換都須重新提交試驗並經設計者書面核准。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification fixes grout class, approved products and prohibitions (no unapproved admixtures added on site, no chloride-bearing materials), and any substitution requires a new test submittal and the designer's written approval.","failure":"注意干擾：2000 年美國北卡羅來納州夏洛特賽車場的人行橋（1995 年建成）因灌漿中添加了未經核准的化學品，造成鋼絞線腐蝕，一跨突然斷落，多名觀眾受傷；材料的一個未授權變更就足以摧毀整套防蝕系統。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: In 2000 a span of the pedestrian bridge at Charlotte Motor Speedway in North Carolina, built in 1995, collapsed suddenly, injuring many spectators, because an unauthorised chemical added to the tendon grout had corroded the strands; a single unapproved change to the material can defeat the whole corrosion-protection system. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"審查灌漿產品的型式試驗報告（流度、泌水、凝結時間、強度、氯離子與硫酸鹽含量）與批號；現場確認包裝未受潮、未過期、儲存條件合格，拌合水來源經水質檢驗，並保留每批材料的出廠證明。","textEn":"Review the grout product's qualification reports (fluidity, bleed, setting time, strength, chloride and sulfate content) and batch numbers; on site confirm bags are dry, in date and properly stored, that mixing water is tested and that mill certificates are kept for every lot.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規格書明定灌漿等級、核可產品與禁止事項（禁止現場添加任何未經核准的外加劑、禁止使用含氯材料），任何材料替換都須重新提交試驗並經設計者書面核准。","textEn":"The specification fixes grout class, approved products and prohibitions (no unapproved admixtures added on site, no chloride-bearing materials), and any substitution requires a new test submittal and the designer's written approval.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。","審查灌漿產品的型式試驗報告（流度、泌水、凝結時間、強度、氯離子與硫酸鹽含量）與批號。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept.","Review the grout product's qualification reports (fluidity, bleed, setting time, strength, chloride and sulfate content) and batch numbers."],"answer":2,"explanation":"審查灌漿產品的型式試驗報告（流度、泌水、凝結時間、強度、氯離子與硫酸鹽含量）與批號；現場確認包裝未受潮、未過期、儲存條件合格，拌合水來源經水質檢驗，並保留每批材料的出廠證明。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Review the grout product's qualification reports (fluidity, bleed, setting time, strength, chloride and sulfate content) and batch numbers; on site confirm bags are dry, in date and properly stored, that mixing water is tested and that mill certificates are kept for every lot. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b054-v13-12","title":"灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「灌漿等級與氯離子上限」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Grout class and chloride limit” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"2000 年美國北卡羅來納州夏洛特賽車場的人行橋（1995 年建成）因灌漿中添加了未經核准的化學品，造成鋼絞線腐蝕，一跨突然斷落，多名觀眾受傷；材料的一個未授權變更就足以摧毀整套防蝕系統。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"In 2000 a span of the pedestrian bridge at Charlotte Motor Speedway in North Carolina, built in 1995, collapsed suddenly, injuring many spectators, because an unauthorised chemical added to the tendon grout had corroded the strands; a single unapproved change to the material can defeat the whole corrosion-protection system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：2001 年後預拌觸變性灌漿普及，但 FHWA 調查顯示部分新橋仍因材料離析、軟化與高氯、高硫酸鹽而腐蝕，說明材料管理與現場拌合同樣重要。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pre-bagged thixotropic grouts spread after 2001, yet FHWA investigations found some newer bridges still corroding because of segregated, soft grout with high chloride and sulfate, showing that material control matters as much as field mixing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"2000 年美國北卡羅來納州夏洛特賽車場的人行橋（1995 年建成）因灌漿中添加了未經核准的化學品，造成鋼絞線腐蝕，一跨突然斷落，多名觀眾受傷；材料的一個未授權變更就足以摧毀整套防蝕系統。","textEn":"In 2000 a span of the pedestrian bridge at Charlotte Motor Speedway in North Carolina, built in 1995, collapsed suddenly, injuring many spectators, because an unauthorised chemical added to the tendon grout had corroded the strands; a single unapproved change to the material can defeat the whole corrosion-protection system.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿材料、配比與氯離子控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Grout materials, mix design and chloride control\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["2000 年美國北卡羅來納州夏洛特賽車場的人行橋（1995 年建成）因灌漿中添加了未經核准的化學品，造成鋼絞線腐蝕，一跨突然斷落，多名觀眾受傷。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。"],"optionsEn":["In 2000 a span of the pedestrian bridge at Charlotte Motor Speedway in North Carolina, built in 1995, collapsed suddenly, injuring many spectators, because an unauthorised chemical added to the tendon grout had corroded the strands.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"2000 年美國北卡羅來納州夏洛特賽車場的人行橋（1995 年建成）因灌漿中添加了未經核准的化學品，造成鋼絞線腐蝕，一跨突然斷落，多名觀眾受傷；材料的一個未授權變更就足以摧毀整套防蝕系統。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In 2000 a span of the pedestrian bridge at Charlotte Motor Speedway in North Carolina, built in 1995, collapsed suddenly, injuring many spectators, because an unauthorised chemical added to the tendon grout had corroded the strands; a single unapproved change to the material can defeat the whole corrosion-protection system. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b054-v13-13","title":"孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Ducts, ports and anchorage details: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「孔道面積比與灌漿量」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Duct area ratio and grout volume” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"孔道必須夠大，讓鋼絞線穿索後仍留有足夠空間讓灌漿流過並包覆每一股；密封的塑膠波紋管比鍍鋅鋼管更能阻絕外部水分與氯離子，但接頭、耦合器與節塊接縫處必須確實密封。灌漿口與排氣管的內徑也有下限，FHWA 手冊建議鋼絞線鋼腱的進出口內徑至少 20 mm，以免灌漿阻塞。錨頭是最容易進水的位置，需以永久封蓋灌滿，再以混凝土封頭與防水層保護。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「孔道面積比與灌漿量」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Ducts must be large enough to leave space for grout to flow around every strand after threading; sealed corrugated plastic ducts block external water and chlorides better than galvanised steel, but joints, couplers and segment interfaces must be properly sealed. Inlets and vents also have minimum sizes; the FHWA manual recommends at least 20 mm internal diameter for strand-tendon ports so grout does not block them. Anchorages are the easiest entry point for water and need permanent caps filled with grout, then concrete pour-backs and waterproofing. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Duct area ratio and grout volume” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：孔道內徑 100 mm，面積 π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm²，鋼絞線 2,660 mm²，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95；每公尺灌漿淨面積 7,854 − 2,660 ≈ 5,194 mm²，100 m 鋼腱理論灌漿量約 0.52 m³。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 100 mm duct has π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm² against 2,660 mm² of strand, an area ratio of about 2.95; the net grout area is about 5,194 mm² per metre, so a 100 m tendon needs about 0.52 m³ of grout in theory.","failure":"常見誤解：「孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「孔道面積比與灌漿量」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Duct area ratio and grout volume”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-13-k1","title":"孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部","titleEn":"Ducts, ports and anchorage details","text":"孔道必須夠大，讓鋼絞線穿索後仍留有足夠空間讓灌漿流過並包覆每一股；密封的塑膠波紋管比鍍鋅鋼管更能阻絕外部水分與氯離子，但接頭、耦合器與節塊接縫處必須確實密封。灌漿口與排氣管的內徑也有下限，FHWA 手冊建議鋼絞線鋼腱的進出口內徑至少 20 mm，以免灌漿阻塞。","textEn":"Ducts must be large enough to leave space for grout to flow around every strand after threading; sealed corrugated plastic ducts block external water and chlorides better than galvanised steel, but joints, couplers and segment interfaces must be properly sealed. Inlets and vents also have minimum sizes; the FHWA manual recommends at least 20 mm internal diameter for strand-tendon ports so grout does not block them.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ducts, ports and anchorage details\" is correct?","options":["孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。","孔道必須夠大，讓鋼絞線穿索後仍留有足夠空間讓灌漿流過並包覆每一股；密封的塑膠波紋管比鍍鋅鋼管更能阻絕外部水分與氯離子，但接頭、耦合器與節塊接縫處必須確實密封。","灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。"],"optionsEn":["A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter.","Ducts must be large enough to leave space for grout to flow around every strand after threading.","The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely."],"answer":1,"explanation":"孔道必須夠大，讓鋼絞線穿索後仍留有足夠空間讓灌漿流過並包覆每一股；密封的塑膠波紋管比鍍鋅鋼管更能阻絕外部水分與氯離子，但接頭、耦合器與節塊接縫處必須確實密封。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Ducts must be large enough to leave space for grout to flow around every strand after threading; sealed corrugated plastic ducts block external water and chlorides better than galvanised steel, but joints, couplers and segment interfaces must be properly sealed. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b054-v13-14","title":"孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部：定量估算","titleEn":"Ducts, ports and anchorage details: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「孔道面積比與灌漿量」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Duct area ratio and grout volume” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：孔道內徑 100 mm，面積 π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm²，鋼絞線 2,660 mm²，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95；每公尺灌漿淨面積 7,854 − 2,660 ≈ 5,194 mm²，100 m 鋼腱理論灌漿量約 0.52 m³。若改用 90 mm 孔道，面積比降為約 2.39。數值為教學假設，面積比下限依規範。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 100 mm duct has π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm² against 2,660 mm² of strand, an area ratio of about 2.95; the net grout area is about 5,194 mm² per metre, so a 100 m tendon needs about 0.52 m³ of grout in theory. A 90 mm duct lowers the ratio to about 2.39. Values are teaching assumptions; the minimum ratio follows the code. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：檢查孔道材料證明、壁厚、接頭與耦合器的密封方式，澆置混凝土前以壓力或真空試驗確認孔道系統氣密；量測灌漿口與排氣管內徑與位置，並在混凝土澆置後以通球或吹氣確認孔道未被壓扁或堵塞。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check duct material certificates, wall thickness and sealing of joints and couplers, and pressure- or vacuum-test the duct system for airtightness before concreting; measure port diameters and locations, and after concreting confirm by pulling a ball or blowing air that ducts are neither crushed nor blocked.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"孔道內徑 100 mm，面積 π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm²，鋼絞線 2,660 mm²，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95；每公尺灌漿淨面積 7,854 − 2,660 ≈ 5,194 mm²，100 m 鋼腱理論灌漿量約 0.52 m³。若改用 90 mm 孔道，面積比降為約 2.39。數值為教學假設，面積比下限依規範。","textEn":"A 100 mm duct has π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm² against 2,660 mm² of strand, an area ratio of about 2.95; the net grout area is about 5,194 mm² per metre, so a 100 m tendon needs about 0.52 m³ of grout in theory. A 90 mm duct lowers the ratio to about 2.39. Values are teaching assumptions; the minimum ratio follows the code.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ducts, ports and anchorage details\", which statement holds?","options":["灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。","使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。","孔道內徑 100 mm，面積 π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm²，鋼絞線 2,660 mm²，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95。"],"optionsEn":["The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality.","New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.","A 100 mm duct has π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm² against 2,660 mm² of strand, an area ratio of about 2.95."],"answer":2,"explanation":"孔道內徑 100 mm，面積 π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm²，鋼絞線 2,660 mm²，面積比 7,854/2,660 ≈ 2.95；每公尺灌漿淨面積 7,854 − 2,660 ≈ 5,194 mm²，100 m 鋼腱理論灌漿量約 0.52 m³。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 100 mm duct has π/4×100² ≈ 7,854 mm² against 2,660 mm² of strand, an area ratio of about 2.95; the net grout area is about 5,194 mm² per metre, so a 100 m tendon needs about 0.52 m³ of grout in theory. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b054-v13-15","title":"孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Ducts, ports and anchorage details: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「孔道面積比與灌漿量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Duct area ratio and grout volume” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"檢查孔道材料證明、壁厚、接頭與耦合器的密封方式，澆置混凝土前以壓力或真空試驗確認孔道系統氣密；量測灌漿口與排氣管內徑與位置，並在混凝土澆置後以通球或吹氣確認孔道未被壓扁或堵塞。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check duct material certificates, wall thickness and sealing of joints and couplers, and pressure- or vacuum-test the duct system for airtightness before concreting; measure port diameters and locations, and after concreting confirm by pulling a ball or blowing air that ducts are neither crushed nor blocked. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把孔道氣密試驗與通孔確認列為澆置混凝土與灌漿前的兩個停留點；錨頭封蓋、封頭混凝土與防水細部在施工圖中逐一繪出，不得留待現場決定。","observationEn":"Site practice: Make duct airtightness testing and clear-passage confirmation hold points before concreting and before grouting; draw anchorage caps, pour-backs and waterproofing details individually on the shop drawings rather than leaving them to site decisions.","failure":"注意干擾：節塊接縫處孔道未以密封環對接，混凝土漿與後來的雨水從接縫進入孔道；混凝土澆置時振動棒壓扁孔道，灌漿無法通過而在一側留下長段空洞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ducts not joined with sealing couplers at segment joints let cement paste and later rainwater enter the duct; a vibrator crushing the duct during concreting stops grout passing and leaves a long void on one side. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"檢查孔道材料證明、壁厚、接頭與耦合器的密封方式，澆置混凝土前以壓力或真空試驗確認孔道系統氣密；量測灌漿口與排氣管內徑與位置，並在混凝土澆置後以通球或吹氣確認孔道未被壓扁或堵塞。","textEn":"Check duct material certificates, wall thickness and sealing of joints and couplers, and pressure- or vacuum-test the duct system for airtightness before concreting; measure port diameters and locations, and after concreting confirm by pulling a ball or blowing air that ducts are neither crushed nor blocked.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把孔道氣密試驗與通孔確認列為澆置混凝土與灌漿前的兩個停留點；錨頭封蓋、封頭混凝土與防水細部在施工圖中逐一繪出，不得留待現場決定。","textEn":"Make duct airtightness testing and clear-passage confirmation hold points before concreting and before grouting; draw anchorage caps, pour-backs and waterproofing details individually on the shop drawings rather than leaving them to site decisions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ducts, ports and anchorage details\"?","options":["檢查孔道材料證明、壁厚、接頭與耦合器的密封方式，澆置混凝土前以壓力或真空試驗確認孔道系統氣密。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。"],"optionsEn":["Check duct material certificates, wall thickness and sealing of joints and couplers, and pressure- or vacuum-test the duct system for airtightness before concreting.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust."],"answer":0,"explanation":"檢查孔道材料證明、壁厚、接頭與耦合器的密封方式，澆置混凝土前以壓力或真空試驗確認孔道系統氣密；量測灌漿口與排氣管內徑與位置，並在混凝土澆置後以通球或吹氣確認孔道未被壓扁或堵塞。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check duct material certificates, wall thickness and sealing of joints and couplers, and pressure- or vacuum-test the duct system for airtightness before concreting; measure port diameters and locations, and after concreting confirm by pulling a ball or blowing air that ducts are neither crushed nor blocked. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b054-v13-16","title":"孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ducts, ports and anchorage details: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「孔道面積比與灌漿量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Duct area ratio and grout volume” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"節塊接縫處孔道未以密封環對接，混凝土漿與後來的雨水從接縫進入孔道；混凝土澆置時振動棒壓扁孔道，灌漿無法通過而在一側留下長段空洞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ducts not joined with sealing couplers at segment joints let cement paste and later rainwater enter the duct; a vibrator crushing the duct during concreting stops grout passing and leaves a long void on one side. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：錨頭是最容易進水的位置，需以永久封蓋灌滿，再以混凝土封頭與防水層保護。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Anchorages are the easiest entry point for water and need permanent caps filled with grout, then concrete pour-backs and waterproofing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"節塊接縫處孔道未以密封環對接，混凝土漿與後來的雨水從接縫進入孔道；混凝土澆置時振動棒壓扁孔道，灌漿無法通過而在一側留下長段空洞。","textEn":"Ducts not joined with sealing couplers at segment joints let cement paste and later rainwater enter the duct; a vibrator crushing the duct during concreting stops grout passing and leaves a long void on one side.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「孔道、灌漿口與錨頭細部」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ducts, ports and anchorage details\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","節塊接縫處孔道未以密封環對接，混凝土漿與後來的雨水從接縫進入孔道；混凝土澆置時振動棒壓扁孔道，灌漿無法通過而在一側留下長段空洞。","灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Ducts not joined with sealing couplers at segment joints let cement paste and later rainwater enter the duct.","The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely."],"answer":1,"explanation":"節塊接縫處孔道未以密封環對接，混凝土漿與後來的雨水從接縫進入孔道；混凝土澆置時振動棒壓扁孔道，灌漿無法通過而在一側留下長段空洞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ducts not joined with sealing couplers at segment joints let cement paste and later rainwater enter the duct; a vibrator crushing the duct during concreting stops grout passing and leaves a long void on one side. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b054-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序」與「錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence\" and \"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b054-v13-17","title":"灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「灌漿推進速度與壓力」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Grout advance rate and pressure” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿要從最低點的灌漿口以連續、穩定的流量推進，讓灌漿前緣把空氣與水推向排氣口；每個排氣口在流出與進料一致、無氣泡的灌漿後才依序關閉，直到最後出漿口確認後再加壓保持一段時間。推進太快會讓灌漿越過鋼絞線間的空氣而形成空洞，太慢或中斷則讓灌漿在孔道內開始凝結。壓力要控制在孔道與錨頭可承受範圍內，垂直或高差大的鋼腱還要考慮靜水壓與雙閥門。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「灌漿推進速度與壓力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Grout is pumped from the lowest inlet at a continuous, steady rate so the grout front pushes air and water toward the vents; each vent is closed in sequence only once grout of the same consistency as the feed, free of bubbles, flows from it, and after the final outlet is confirmed the system is held under pressure for a period. Advancing too fast lets grout bypass air between strands and leave voids; too slow, or interrupted, lets grout begin to set inside the duct. Pressure must stay within what ducts and anchorages can take, and vertical or steep tendons must also consider static head and double valves. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Grout advance rate and pressure” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：幫浦流量 30 L/min，孔道淨面積 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m，推進速度 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min；100 m 鋼腱 0.52 m³ 約需 17 分鐘連續灌注。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At a pump rate of 30 L/min and a net duct area of 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m, the grout advances at 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min, so a 100 m tendon of 0.52 m³ needs about 17 minutes of continuous pumping.","failure":"常見誤解：「灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「灌漿推進速度與壓力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Grout advance rate and pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-17-k1","title":"灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序","titleEn":"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence","text":"灌漿要從最低點的灌漿口以連續、穩定的流量推進，讓灌漿前緣把空氣與水推向排氣口；每個排氣口在流出與進料一致、無氣泡的灌漿後才依序關閉，直到最後出漿口確認後再加壓保持一段時間。推進太快會讓灌漿越過鋼絞線間的空氣而形成空洞，太慢或中斷則讓灌漿在孔道內開始凝結。","textEn":"Grout is pumped from the lowest inlet at a continuous, steady rate so the grout front pushes air and water toward the vents; each vent is closed in sequence only once grout of the same consistency as the feed, free of bubbles, flows from it, and after the final outlet is confirmed the system is held under pressure for a period. Advancing too fast lets grout bypass air between strands and leave voids; too slow, or interrupted, lets grout begin to set inside the duct.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence\" is correct?","options":["灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。","灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","灌漿要從最低點的灌漿口以連續、穩定的流量推進，讓灌漿前緣把空氣與水推向排氣口。"],"optionsEn":["The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely.","If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","Grout is pumped from the lowest inlet at a continuous, steady rate so the grout front pushes air and water toward the vents."],"answer":2,"explanation":"灌漿要從最低點的灌漿口以連續、穩定的流量推進，讓灌漿前緣把空氣與水推向排氣口；每個排氣口在流出與進料一致、無氣泡的灌漿後才依序關閉，直到最後出漿口確認後再加壓保持一段時間。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Grout is pumped from the lowest inlet at a continuous, steady rate so the grout front pushes air and water toward the vents; each vent is closed in sequence only once grout of the same consistency as the feed, free of bubbles, flows from it, and after the final outlet is confirmed the system is held under pressure for a period. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b054-v13-18","title":"灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序：定量估算","titleEn":"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「灌漿推進速度與壓力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Grout advance rate and pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：幫浦流量 30 L/min，孔道淨面積 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m，推進速度 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min；100 m 鋼腱 0.52 m³ 約需 17 分鐘連續灌注。若高點比灌漿口高 3 m、灌漿密度 1,900 kg/m³，靜水壓 1,900×9.81×3 ≈ 56 kPa，須加在摩擦損失之上。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At a pump rate of 30 L/min and a net duct area of 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m, the grout advances at 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min, so a 100 m tendon of 0.52 m³ needs about 17 minutes of continuous pumping. With a crest 3 m above the inlet and grout density 1,900 kg/m³, static head is 1,900×9.81×3 ≈ 56 kPa, added to friction losses. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：灌漿前確認幫浦、備用幫浦與足夠材料就位，逐條鋼腱記錄開始與結束時間、壓力歷程、各排氣口關閉時間與出漿狀態；在出漿口取樣量測流度與密度，與進料比較，確認出口灌漿未被稀釋或混入空氣。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before grouting confirm the pump, a standby pump and sufficient material are ready; for each tendon record start and finish times, pressure history, vent closing times and outflow condition; sample at the outlet for fluidity and density and compare with the feed to confirm the outflow is neither diluted nor aerated.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"幫浦流量 30 L/min，孔道淨面積 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m，推進速度 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min；100 m 鋼腱 0.52 m³ 約需 17 分鐘連續灌注。若高點比灌漿口高 3 m、灌漿密度 1,900 kg/m³，靜水壓 1,900×9.81×3 ≈ 56 kPa，須加在摩擦損失之上。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"At a pump rate of 30 L/min and a net duct area of 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m, the grout advances at 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min, so a 100 m tendon of 0.52 m³ needs about 17 minutes of continuous pumping. With a crest 3 m above the inlet and grout density 1,900 kg/m³, static head is 1,900×9.81×3 ≈ 56 kPa, added to friction losses. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence\", which statement holds?","options":["幫浦流量 30 L/min，孔道淨面積 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m，推進速度 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min。","非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。","灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。"],"optionsEn":["At a pump rate of 30 L/min and a net duct area of 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m, the grout advances at 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min, so a 100 m tendon of 0.52 m³ needs about 17 minutes of continuous pumping.","Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty.","Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept."],"answer":0,"explanation":"幫浦流量 30 L/min，孔道淨面積 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m，推進速度 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min；100 m 鋼腱 0.52 m³ 約需 17 分鐘連續灌注。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At a pump rate of 30 L/min and a net duct area of 5,194 mm² = 5.19 L/m, the grout advances at 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m/min, so a 100 m tendon of 0.52 m³ needs about 17 minutes of continuous pumping. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b054-v13-19","title":"灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌漿推進速度與壓力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Grout advance rate and pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"灌漿前確認幫浦、備用幫浦與足夠材料就位，逐條鋼腱記錄開始與結束時間、壓力歷程、各排氣口關閉時間與出漿狀態；在出漿口取樣量測流度與密度，與進料比較，確認出口灌漿未被稀釋或混入空氣。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before grouting confirm the pump, a standby pump and sufficient material are ready; for each tendon record start and finish times, pressure history, vent closing times and outflow condition; sample at the outlet for fluidity and density and compare with the feed to confirm the outflow is neither diluted nor aerated. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：灌漿作業由取得專業認證的人員執行並由監造全程見證，每條鋼腱的灌漿紀錄當場簽認；中斷時依事先核准的應變程序（例如立即以水沖洗或改由另一灌漿口完成）處理，不得臨場自行判斷。","observationEn":"Site practice: Grouting is carried out by certified specialists and witnessed throughout by the inspector, with each tendon's record signed on the spot; interruptions follow a pre-approved contingency (for example immediate flushing or completion from another inlet), never improvisation.","failure":"注意干擾：灌漿中途幫浦故障而沒有備用設備，孔道內灌漿停留過久開始凝結，再次啟動時壓力暴增而無法完成，留下半段空孔道；或排氣口一見到灌漿就關閉，前緣夾帶的水與空氣被封在孔道內。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A pump failure mid-tendon with no standby leaves grout standing until it begins to set, so restarting spikes the pressure and the tendon cannot be completed, leaving half the duct empty; closing vents as soon as any grout appears traps the water and air carried at the front inside the duct. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"灌漿前確認幫浦、備用幫浦與足夠材料就位，逐條鋼腱記錄開始與結束時間、壓力歷程、各排氣口關閉時間與出漿狀態；在出漿口取樣量測流度與密度，與進料比較，確認出口灌漿未被稀釋或混入空氣。","textEn":"Before grouting confirm the pump, a standby pump and sufficient material are ready; for each tendon record start and finish times, pressure history, vent closing times and outflow condition; sample at the outlet for fluidity and density and compare with the feed to confirm the outflow is neither diluted nor aerated.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"灌漿作業由取得專業認證的人員執行並由監造全程見證，每條鋼腱的灌漿紀錄當場簽認；中斷時依事先核准的應變程序（例如立即以水沖洗或改由另一灌漿口完成）處理，不得臨場自行判斷。","textEn":"Grouting is carried out by certified specialists and witnessed throughout by the inspector, with each tendon's record signed on the spot; interruptions follow a pre-approved contingency (for example immediate flushing or completion from another inlet), never improvisation.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","灌漿前確認幫浦、備用幫浦與足夠材料就位，逐條鋼腱記錄開始與結束時間、壓力歷程、各排氣口關閉時間與出漿狀態。","灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before grouting confirm the pump, a standby pump and sufficient material are ready.","If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled."],"answer":1,"explanation":"灌漿前確認幫浦、備用幫浦與足夠材料就位，逐條鋼腱記錄開始與結束時間、壓力歷程、各排氣口關閉時間與出漿狀態；在出漿口取樣量測流度與密度，與進料比較，確認出口灌漿未被稀釋或混入空氣。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before grouting confirm the pump, a standby pump and sufficient material are ready; for each tendon record start and finish times, pressure history, vent closing times and outflow condition; sample at the outlet for fluidity and density and compare with the feed to confirm the outflow is neither diluted nor aerated. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b054-v13-20","title":"灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序：失效診斷","titleEn":"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「灌漿推進速度與壓力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Grout advance rate and pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"灌漿中途幫浦故障而沒有備用設備，孔道內灌漿停留過久開始凝結，再次啟動時壓力暴增而無法完成，留下半段空孔道；或排氣口一見到灌漿就關閉，前緣夾帶的水與空氣被封在孔道內。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A pump failure mid-tendon with no standby leaves grout standing until it begins to set, so restarting spikes the pressure and the tendon cannot be completed, leaving half the duct empty; closing vents as soon as any grout appears traps the water and air carried at the front inside the duct. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：壓力要控制在孔道與錨頭可承受範圍內，垂直或高差大的鋼腱還要考慮靜水壓與雙閥門。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pressure must stay within what ducts and anchorages can take, and vertical or steep tendons must also consider static head and double valves.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"灌漿中途幫浦故障而沒有備用設備，孔道內灌漿停留過久開始凝結，再次啟動時壓力暴增而無法完成，留下半段空孔道；或排氣口一見到灌漿就關閉，前緣夾帶的水與空氣被封在孔道內。","textEn":"A pump failure mid-tendon with no standby leaves grout standing until it begins to set, so restarting spikes the pressure and the tendon cannot be completed, leaving half the duct empty; closing vents as soon as any grout appears traps the water and air carried at the front inside the duct.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿程序、壓力與排氣順序」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Grouting procedure, pressure and venting sequence\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","灌漿中途幫浦故障而沒有備用設備，孔道內灌漿停留過久開始凝結，再次啟動時壓力暴增而無法完成，留下半段空孔道。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","A pump failure mid-tendon with no standby leaves grout standing until it begins to set, so restarting spikes the pressure and the tendon cannot be completed, leaving half the duct empty."],"answer":2,"explanation":"灌漿中途幫浦故障而沒有備用設備，孔道內灌漿停留過久開始凝結，再次啟動時壓力暴增而無法完成，留下半段空孔道；或排氣口一見到灌漿就關閉，前緣夾帶的水與空氣被封在孔道內。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A pump failure mid-tendon with no standby leaves grout standing until it begins to set, so restarting spikes the pressure and the tendon cannot be completed, leaving half the duct empty; closing vents as soon as any grout appears traps the water and air carried at the front inside the duct. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b054-v13-21","title":"錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「真空補灌與空洞體積」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Vacuum regrouting and void volume” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿完成並初凝後，要檢查高點與錨頭是否因沉降或泌水被吸收而出現空洞：常見做法是在高點排氣管與錨頭封蓋處開孔，以探針或內視鏡觀察，必要時以真空輔助補灌。真空補灌先把空洞抽成低壓，再讓灌漿被吸入，能填入細小且彎曲的空間；以已知容積的儲氣槽連接空洞並觀察壓力平衡，即可依波以耳定律估算空洞體積，進而確認補灌量。錨頭最後以永久封蓋、封頭混凝土與防水塗層多層保護。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「真空補灌與空洞體積」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After grouting and initial set, high points and anchorages are checked for voids caused by settlement or bleed reabsorption: vents at crests and anchorage caps are opened and probed or viewed with a borescope, and vacuum-assisted regrouting is used where needed. Vacuum regrouting first evacuates the void, then lets grout be drawn in, filling small and tortuous spaces; connecting a reservoir of known volume to the void and observing the pressure equalisation estimates the void volume by Boyle's law, confirming the regrout quantity. The anchorage is finally protected in layers by a permanent cap, a concrete pour-back and a waterproof coating. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Vacuum regrouting and void volume” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：波以耳定律 p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Boyle's law p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v).","failure":"常見誤解：「灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「真空補灌與空洞體積」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Vacuum regrouting and void volume”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-21-k1","title":"錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查","titleEn":"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks","text":"灌漿完成並初凝後，要檢查高點與錨頭是否因沉降或泌水被吸收而出現空洞：常見做法是在高點排氣管與錨頭封蓋處開孔，以探針或內視鏡觀察，必要時以真空輔助補灌。真空補灌先把空洞抽成低壓，再讓灌漿被吸入，能填入細小且彎曲的空間；以已知容積的儲氣槽連接空洞並觀察壓力平衡，即可依波以耳定律估算空洞體積，進而確認補灌量。","textEn":"After grouting and initial set, high points and anchorages are checked for voids caused by settlement or bleed reabsorption: vents at crests and anchorage caps are opened and probed or viewed with a borescope, and vacuum-assisted regrouting is used where needed. Vacuum regrouting first evacuates the void, then lets grout be drawn in, filling small and tortuous spaces; connecting a reservoir of known volume to the void and observing the pressure equalisation estimates the void volume by Boyle's law, confirming the regrout quantity.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks\" is correct?","options":["灌漿完成並初凝後，要檢查高點與錨頭是否因沉降或泌水被吸收而出現空洞：常見做法是在高點排氣管與錨頭封蓋處開孔，以探針或內視鏡觀察，必要時以真空輔助補灌。","灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["After grouting and initial set, high points and anchorages are checked for voids caused by settlement or bleed reabsorption: vents at crests and anchorage caps are opened and probed or viewed with a borescope, and vacuum-assisted regrouting is used where needed.","If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"灌漿完成並初凝後，要檢查高點與錨頭是否因沉降或泌水被吸收而出現空洞：常見做法是在高點排氣管與錨頭封蓋處開孔，以探針或內視鏡觀察，必要時以真空輔助補灌。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After grouting and initial set, high points and anchorages are checked for voids caused by settlement or bleed reabsorption: vents at crests and anchorage caps are opened and probed or viewed with a borescope, and vacuum-assisted regrouting is used where needed. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b054-v13-22","title":"錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查：定量估算","titleEn":"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「真空補灌與空洞體積」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Vacuum regrouting and void volume” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：波以耳定律 p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v)。儲氣槽 V_r = 20 L、1.0 bar，空洞抽到 0.1 bar，連通後平衡為 0.8 bar：20×1.0 + 0.1V_v = 0.8×(20 + V_v)，得 V_v = 4/0.7 ≈ 5.7 L，即約 1.1 m 長孔道的淨灌漿體積。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Boyle's law p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v). With a 20 L reservoir at 1.0 bar, a void evacuated to 0.1 bar and equalisation at 0.8 bar: 20×1.0 + 0.1V_v = 0.8×(20 + V_v), so V_v = 4/0.7 ≈ 5.7 L, the net grout volume of about 1.1 m of duct. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：依計畫在每條鋼腱的高點與錨頭抽查空洞，以探針或量規量測空洞深度並記錄位置；補灌後重新檢查，確認補灌量與估算空洞體積一致；錨頭封蓋灌滿後以敲擊或開孔抽查，封頭混凝土與防水層依圖施作並拍照存證。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check for voids at each tendon's crests and anchorages as planned, measuring depth with a probe or gauge and recording location; after regrouting recheck and confirm that the regrout quantity matches the estimated void volume; after caps are filled check by sounding or test holes, and build pour-backs and waterproofing as drawn with photographic records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"波以耳定律 p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v)。儲氣槽 V_r = 20 L、1.0 bar，空洞抽到 0.1 bar，連通後平衡為 0.8 bar：20×1.0 + 0.1V_v = 0.8×(20 + V_v)，得 V_v = 4/0.7 ≈ 5.7 L，即約 1.1 m 長孔道的淨灌漿體積。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Boyle's law p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v). With a 20 L reservoir at 1.0 bar, a void evacuated to 0.1 bar and equalisation at 0.8 bar: 20×1.0 + 0.1V_v = 0.8×(20 + V_v), so V_v = 4/0.7 ≈ 5.7 L, the net grout volume of about 1.1 m of duct. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks\", which statement holds?","options":["使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。","波以耳定律 p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v)。","鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。"],"optionsEn":["New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.","Boyle's law p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v).","Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波以耳定律 p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Boyle's law p_r·V_r + p_v·V_v = p_f·(V_r + V_v). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b054-v13-23","title":"錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「真空補灌與空洞體積」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Vacuum regrouting and void volume” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"依計畫在每條鋼腱的高點與錨頭抽查空洞，以探針或量規量測空洞深度並記錄位置；補灌後重新檢查，確認補灌量與估算空洞體積一致；錨頭封蓋灌滿後以敲擊或開孔抽查，封頭混凝土與防水層依圖施作並拍照存證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check for voids at each tendon's crests and anchorages as planned, measuring depth with a probe or gauge and recording location; after regrouting recheck and confirm that the regrout quantity matches the estimated void volume; after caps are filled check by sounding or test holes, and build pour-backs and waterproofing as drawn with photographic records. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把「初凝後高點與錨頭空洞檢查」與「錨頭封護完成」列為獨立的停留點，檢查孔洞事後以相容材料封閉；補灌由合格人員依核准程序進行，結果寫入該鋼腱的灌漿紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: Make the post-set void check at crests and anchorages and completion of anchorage protection separate hold points, sealing inspection holes afterwards with compatible material; regrouting is done by qualified personnel to an approved procedure and recorded in that tendon's grouting record.","failure":"注意干擾：完工後沒有檢查高點與錨頭，泌水被吸收後留下的空洞與封蓋內未填滿的空間長期存在；錨頭封頭混凝土開裂後，雨水與除冰鹽直接進入錨頭與鋼絞線端部，是許多鋼腱腐蝕案例的起點。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without checks at crests and anchorages after completion, voids left by reabsorbed bleed water and unfilled cap space persist for years; once the anchorage pour-back cracks, rain and de-icing salt enter the anchorage and strand ends directly, the starting point of many tendon corrosion cases. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依計畫在每條鋼腱的高點與錨頭抽查空洞，以探針或量規量測空洞深度並記錄位置；補灌後重新檢查，確認補灌量與估算空洞體積一致；錨頭封蓋灌滿後以敲擊或開孔抽查，封頭混凝土與防水層依圖施作並拍照存證。","textEn":"Check for voids at each tendon's crests and anchorages as planned, measuring depth with a probe or gauge and recording location; after regrouting recheck and confirm that the regrout quantity matches the estimated void volume; after caps are filled check by sounding or test holes, and build pour-backs and waterproofing as drawn with photographic records.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把「初凝後高點與錨頭空洞檢查」與「錨頭封護完成」列為獨立的停留點，檢查孔洞事後以相容材料封閉；補灌由合格人員依核准程序進行，結果寫入該鋼腱的灌漿紀錄。","textEn":"Make the post-set void check at crests and anchorages and completion of anchorage protection separate hold points, sealing inspection holes afterwards with compatible material; regrouting is done by qualified personnel to an approved procedure and recorded in that tendon's grouting record.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。","依計畫在每條鋼腱的高點與錨頭抽查空洞，以探針或量規量測空洞深度並記錄位置。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.","Check for voids at each tendon's crests and anchorages as planned, measuring depth with a probe or gauge and recording location."],"answer":2,"explanation":"依計畫在每條鋼腱的高點與錨頭抽查空洞，以探針或量規量測空洞深度並記錄位置；補灌後重新檢查，確認補灌量與估算空洞體積一致；錨頭封蓋灌滿後以敲擊或開孔抽查，封頭混凝土與防水層依圖施作並拍照存證。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check for voids at each tendon's crests and anchorages as planned, measuring depth with a probe or gauge and recording location; after regrouting recheck and confirm that the regrout quantity matches the estimated void volume; after caps are filled check by sounding or test holes, and build pour-backs and waterproofing as drawn with photographic records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b054-v13-24","title":"錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查：失效診斷","titleEn":"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「真空補灌與空洞體積」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Vacuum regrouting and void volume” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"完工後沒有檢查高點與錨頭，泌水被吸收後留下的空洞與封蓋內未填滿的空間長期存在；錨頭封頭混凝土開裂後，雨水與除冰鹽直接進入錨頭與鋼絞線端部，是許多鋼腱腐蝕案例的起點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without checks at crests and anchorages after completion, voids left by reabsorbed bleed water and unfilled cap space persist for years; once the anchorage pour-back cracks, rain and de-icing salt enter the anchorage and strand ends directly, the starting point of many tendon corrosion cases. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：錨頭最後以永久封蓋、封頭混凝土與防水塗層多層保護。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The anchorage is finally protected in layers by a permanent cap, a concrete pour-back and a waterproof coating.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"完工後沒有檢查高點與錨頭，泌水被吸收後留下的空洞與封蓋內未填滿的空間長期存在；錨頭封頭混凝土開裂後，雨水與除冰鹽直接進入錨頭與鋼絞線端部，是許多鋼腱腐蝕案例的起點。","textEn":"Without checks at crests and anchorages after completion, voids left by reabsorbed bleed water and unfilled cap space persist for years; once the anchorage pour-back cracks, rain and de-icing salt enter the anchorage and strand ends directly, the starting point of many tendon corrosion cases.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「錨頭封護、空洞補灌與完工檢查」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Anchorage protection, void regrouting and completion checks\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["完工後沒有檢查高點與錨頭，泌水被吸收後留下的空洞與封蓋內未填滿的空間長期存在。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["Without checks at crests and anchorages after completion, voids left by reabsorbed bleed water and unfilled cap space persist for years.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"完工後沒有檢查高點與錨頭，泌水被吸收後留下的空洞與封蓋內未填滿的空間長期存在；錨頭封頭混凝土開裂後，雨水與除冰鹽直接進入錨頭與鋼絞線端部，是許多鋼腱腐蝕案例的起點。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without checks at crests and anchorages after completion, voids left by reabsorbed bleed water and unfilled cap space persist for years; once the anchorage pour-back cracks, rain and de-icing salt enter the anchorage and strand ends directly, the starting point of many tendon corrosion cases. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b054-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌」與「空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Grout testing and field mock-ups\" and \"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b054-v13-25","title":"灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Grout testing and field mock-ups: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿品質要以試驗證明：流錐試驗（ASTM C939 標準或改良式）量測一定體積灌漿流出的時間，反映流動性；燈芯泌水試驗把鋼絞線插入灌漿柱，模擬鋼絞線吸水造成的泌水；加壓泌水試驗以過濾漏斗在壓力下量測水分分離，反映高差大的鋼腱中灌漿是否會被擠出水分；傾斜管試驗則以實尺寸傾斜孔道檢查高點空洞。現場還可用泥漿密度計快速檢查是否多加了水。重要工程先做實尺寸試灌，剖開確認填充品質。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Grout quality must be proven by testing: the flow-cone test (ASTM C939 standard or modified) times the efflux of a fixed volume to reflect fluidity; the wick-induced bleed test inserts strand into a grout column to mimic water drawn along strands; the bleed-under-pressure test uses a filtration funnel to measure water separation under pressure, reflecting whether grout in tall tendons will be squeezed dry; and the inclined-tube test checks high-point voids in a full-size inclined duct. On site a mud balance quickly checks whether extra water was added. Important projects first grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open to confirm filling. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：理論密度 ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Theoretical density ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c).","failure":"常見誤解：「灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-25-k1","title":"灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌","titleEn":"Grout testing and field mock-ups","text":"灌漿品質要以試驗證明：流錐試驗（ASTM C939 標準或改良式）量測一定體積灌漿流出的時間，反映流動性；燈芯泌水試驗把鋼絞線插入灌漿柱，模擬鋼絞線吸水造成的泌水；加壓泌水試驗以過濾漏斗在壓力下量測水分分離，反映高差大的鋼腱中灌漿是否會被擠出水分；傾斜管試驗則以實尺寸傾斜孔道檢查高點空洞。現場還可用泥漿密度計快速檢查是否多加了水。","textEn":"Grout quality must be proven by testing: the flow-cone test (ASTM C939 standard or modified) times the efflux of a fixed volume to reflect fluidity; the wick-induced bleed test inserts strand into a grout column to mimic water drawn along strands; the bleed-under-pressure test uses a filtration funnel to measure water separation under pressure, reflecting whether grout in tall tendons will be squeezed dry; and the inclined-tube test checks high-point voids in a full-size inclined duct. On site a mud balance quickly checks whether extra water was added.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Grout testing and field mock-ups\" is correct?","options":["灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。","灌漿品質要以試驗證明：流錐試驗（ASTM C939 標準或改良式）量測一定體積灌漿流出的時間，反映流動性。","非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。"],"optionsEn":["The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality.","Grout quality must be proven by testing: the flow-cone test (ASTM C939 standard or modified) times the efflux of a fixed volume to reflect fluidity.","Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty."],"answer":1,"explanation":"灌漿品質要以試驗證明：流錐試驗（ASTM C939 標準或改良式）量測一定體積灌漿流出的時間，反映流動性；燈芯泌水試驗把鋼絞線插入灌漿柱，模擬鋼絞線吸水造成的泌水；加壓泌水試驗以過濾漏斗在壓力下量測水分分離，反映高差大的鋼腱中灌漿是否會被擠出水分；傾斜管試驗則以實尺寸傾斜孔道檢查高點空洞。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Grout quality must be proven by testing: the flow-cone test (ASTM C939 standard or modified) times the efflux of a fixed volume to reflect fluidity; the wick-induced bleed test inserts strand into a grout column to mimic water drawn along strands; the bleed-under-pressure test uses a filtration funnel to measure water separation under pressure, reflecting whether grout in tall tendons will be squeezed dry; and the inclined-tube test checks high-point voids in a full-size inclined duct. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b054-v13-26","title":"灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌：定量估算","titleEn":"Grout testing and field mock-ups: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：理論密度 ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)。水泥比重 3.15、w/c = 0.40：ρ = 1.40/(0.3175 + 0.40) ≈ 1.95 kg/L；若現場多加水使 w/c = 0.45，ρ = 1.45/0.7675 ≈ 1.89 kg/L，低約 62 kg/m³。燈芯泌水試驗 800 mL 試樣分離 2 mL 水，泌水率 0.25%，對要求 0% 的觸變性灌漿判定不合格。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Theoretical density ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c). With cement specific gravity 3.15 and w/c = 0.40, ρ = 1.40/(0.3175 + 0.40) ≈ 1.95 kg/L; extra water raising w/c to 0.45 gives ρ = 1.45/0.7675 ≈ 1.89 kg/L, about 62 kg/m³ lower. A wick-bleed sample of 800 mL separating 2 mL of water shows 0.25% bleed and fails a thixotropic grout required to show 0%. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：送審階段以實驗室試驗確認材料符合規格；開工前做實尺寸試灌並剖開檢查；施工中每批拌合量測流錐時間與密度，並依規定頻率做泌水與抗壓試驗，結果與允收值比較，不合格批次立即廢棄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At submittal confirm by laboratory tests that the material meets the specification; before production grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open; during production measure flow-cone time and density for every batch and run bleed and compressive tests at the specified frequency, comparing with acceptance values and discarding failing batches immediately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"理論密度 ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)。水泥比重 3.15、w/c = 0.40：ρ = 1.40/(0.3175 + 0.40) ≈ 1.95 kg/L；若現場多加水使 w/c = 0.45，ρ = 1.45/0.7675 ≈ 1.89 kg/L，低約 62 kg/m³。燈芯泌水試驗 800 mL 試樣分離 2 mL 水，泌水率 0.25%，對要求 0% 的觸變性灌漿判定不合格。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Theoretical density ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c). With cement specific gravity 3.15 and w/c = 0.40, ρ = 1.40/(0.3175 + 0.40) ≈ 1.95 kg/L; extra water raising w/c to 0.45 gives ρ = 1.45/0.7675 ≈ 1.89 kg/L, about 62 kg/m³ lower. A wick-bleed sample of 800 mL separating 2 mL of water shows 0.25% bleed and fails a thixotropic grout required to show 0%. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Grout testing and field mock-ups\", which statement holds?","options":["灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。","灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。","理論密度 ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)。"],"optionsEn":["Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept.","If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled.","Theoretical density ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"理論密度 ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Theoretical density ρ = (1 + w/c)/(1/G_c + w/c). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b054-v13-27","title":"灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Grout testing and field mock-ups: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"送審階段以實驗室試驗確認材料符合規格；開工前做實尺寸試灌並剖開檢查；施工中每批拌合量測流錐時間與密度，並依規定頻率做泌水與抗壓試驗，結果與允收值比較，不合格批次立即廢棄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At submittal confirm by laboratory tests that the material meets the specification; before production grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open; during production measure flow-cone time and density for every batch and run bleed and compressive tests at the specified frequency, comparing with acceptance values and discarding failing batches immediately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：品質計畫列出每項試驗的標準、頻率、允收值與退料規則，拌合加水量以計量設備控制並記錄；實尺寸試灌與剖開檢查列為正式灌漿前的停留點，由設計者或其代表見證。","observationEn":"Site practice: The quality plan lists standard, frequency, acceptance value and rejection rule for each test, with mixing water metered and recorded; the full-size mock-up and its sectioning are a hold point before production grouting, witnessed by the designer or a representative.","failure":"注意干擾：現場為了讓灌漿好打而多加水，流錐時間變短看似「更順」，但泌水大增，高點留下水層與空洞；若只在開工第一天做試驗，之後的材料批號變化或拌合時間不足都不會被發現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Adding water on site to ease pumping shortens the flow-cone time and seems smoother, but bleed rises sharply and crests are left with water lenses and voids; testing only on the first day lets later batch changes or short mixing times go unnoticed. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"送審階段以實驗室試驗確認材料符合規格；開工前做實尺寸試灌並剖開檢查；施工中每批拌合量測流錐時間與密度，並依規定頻率做泌水與抗壓試驗，結果與允收值比較，不合格批次立即廢棄。","textEn":"At submittal confirm by laboratory tests that the material meets the specification; before production grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open; during production measure flow-cone time and density for every batch and run bleed and compressive tests at the specified frequency, comparing with acceptance values and discarding failing batches immediately.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"品質計畫列出每項試驗的標準、頻率、允收值與退料規則，拌合加水量以計量設備控制並記錄；實尺寸試灌與剖開檢查列為正式灌漿前的停留點，由設計者或其代表見證。","textEn":"The quality plan lists standard, frequency, acceptance value and rejection rule for each test, with mixing water metered and recorded; the full-size mock-up and its sectioning are a hold point before production grouting, witnessed by the designer or a representative.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Grout testing and field mock-ups\"?","options":["送審階段以實驗室試驗確認材料符合規格。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。"],"optionsEn":["At submittal confirm by laboratory tests that the material meets the specification.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"送審階段以實驗室試驗確認材料符合規格；開工前做實尺寸試灌並剖開檢查；施工中每批拌合量測流錐時間與密度，並依規定頻率做泌水與抗壓試驗，結果與允收值比較，不合格批次立即廢棄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"At submittal confirm by laboratory tests that the material meets the specification; before production grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open; during production measure flow-cone time and density for every batch and run bleed and compressive tests at the specified frequency, comparing with acceptance values and discarding failing batches immediately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b054-v13-28","title":"灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌：失效診斷","titleEn":"Grout testing and field mock-ups: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「流錐、泌水與密度試驗」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Flow-cone, bleed and density tests” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"現場為了讓灌漿好打而多加水，流錐時間變短看似「更順」，但泌水大增，高點留下水層與空洞；若只在開工第一天做試驗，之後的材料批號變化或拌合時間不足都不會被發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Adding water on site to ease pumping shortens the flow-cone time and seems smoother, but bleed rises sharply and crests are left with water lenses and voids; testing only on the first day lets later batch changes or short mixing times go unnoticed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：重要工程先做實尺寸試灌，剖開確認填充品質。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Important projects first grout a full-size mock-up and cut it open to confirm filling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"現場為了讓灌漿好打而多加水，流錐時間變短看似「更順」，但泌水大增，高點留下水層與空洞；若只在開工第一天做試驗，之後的材料批號變化或拌合時間不足都不會被發現。","textEn":"Adding water on site to ease pumping shortens the flow-cone time and seems smoother, but bleed rises sharply and crests are left with water lenses and voids; testing only on the first day lets later batch changes or short mixing times go unnoticed.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿材料試驗與現場試灌」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Grout testing and field mock-ups\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","現場為了讓灌漿好打而多加水，流錐時間變短看似「更順」，但泌水大增，高點留下水層與空洞；若只在開工第一天做試驗，之後的材料批號變化或拌合時間不足都不會被發現。","非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Adding water on site to ease pumping shortens the flow-cone time and seems smoother, but bleed rises sharply and crests are left with water lenses and voids.","Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty."],"answer":1,"explanation":"現場為了讓灌漿好打而多加水，流錐時間變短看似「更順」，但泌水大增，高點留下水層與空洞；若只在開工第一天做試驗，之後的材料批號變化或拌合時間不足都不會被發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Adding water on site to ease pumping shortens the flow-cone time and seems smoother, but bleed rises sharply and crests are left with water lenses and voids; testing only on the first day lets later batch changes or short mixing times go unnoticed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b054-v13-29","title":"空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「敲擊回音頻率」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Impact-echo frequency” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"完工後或既有橋梁的灌漿狀態只能間接判斷：透地雷達先定位內部鋼腱，敲擊回音法以應力波在混凝土中反射的頻率判斷孔道處是否有空洞，超音波斷層掃描可建立斷面影像，放射線攝影則能直接看見孔道內部但受安全與厚度限制。非破壞結果有疑問時，再以小孔鑽入孔道、用內視鏡觀察並取樣檢驗灌漿的氯離子與硫酸鹽。FHWA 2013 年的指引提醒，侵入式檢測本身會製造腐蝕通道，取樣數量應盡量少並確實修復。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「敲擊回音頻率」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The grout condition of completed or existing bridges can only be judged indirectly: ground-penetrating radar first locates internal tendons, impact-echo uses the frequency of stress waves reflected in the concrete to judge whether a duct contains voids, ultrasonic tomography builds section images, and radiography sees inside ducts directly but is limited by safety and thickness. Where non-destructive results are doubtful, a small hole is drilled into the duct, inspected with a borescope and the grout sampled for chloride and sulfate. FHWA's 2013 guidance warns that invasive testing itself creates corrosion paths, so the number of samples should be minimised and every hole properly repaired. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Impact-echo frequency” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：敲擊回音厚度頻率 f = β·C_p/(2T)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Impact-echo thickness frequency f = β·C_p/(2T).","failure":"常見誤解：「非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「敲擊回音頻率」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Impact-echo frequency”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-29-k1","title":"空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測","titleEn":"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection","text":"完工後或既有橋梁的灌漿狀態只能間接判斷：透地雷達先定位內部鋼腱，敲擊回音法以應力波在混凝土中反射的頻率判斷孔道處是否有空洞，超音波斷層掃描可建立斷面影像，放射線攝影則能直接看見孔道內部但受安全與厚度限制。非破壞結果有疑問時，再以小孔鑽入孔道、用內視鏡觀察並取樣檢驗灌漿的氯離子與硫酸鹽。","textEn":"The grout condition of completed or existing bridges can only be judged indirectly: ground-penetrating radar first locates internal tendons, impact-echo uses the frequency of stress waves reflected in the concrete to judge whether a duct contains voids, ultrasonic tomography builds section images, and radiography sees inside ducts directly but is limited by safety and thickness. Where non-destructive results are doubtful, a small hole is drilled into the duct, inspected with a borescope and the grout sampled for chloride and sulfate.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection\" is correct?","options":["非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。","使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。","完工後或既有橋梁的灌漿狀態只能間接判斷：透地雷達先定位內部鋼腱，敲擊回音法以應力波在混凝土中反射的頻率判斷孔道處是否有空洞，超音波斷層掃描可建立斷面影像，放射線攝影則能直接看見孔道內部但受安全與厚度限制。"],"optionsEn":["Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty.","New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.","The grout condition of completed or existing bridges can only be judged indirectly: ground-penetrating radar first locates internal tendons, impact-echo uses the frequency of stress waves reflected in the concrete to judge whether a duct contains voids, ultrasonic tomography builds section images, and radiography sees inside ducts directly but is limited by safety and thickness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"完工後或既有橋梁的灌漿狀態只能間接判斷：透地雷達先定位內部鋼腱，敲擊回音法以應力波在混凝土中反射的頻率判斷孔道處是否有空洞，超音波斷層掃描可建立斷面影像，放射線攝影則能直接看見孔道內部但受安全與厚度限制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The grout condition of completed or existing bridges can only be judged indirectly: ground-penetrating radar first locates internal tendons, impact-echo uses the frequency of stress waves reflected in the concrete to judge whether a duct contains voids, ultrasonic tomography builds section images, and radiography sees inside ducts directly but is limited by safety and thickness. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b054-v13-30","title":"空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測：定量估算","titleEn":"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「敲擊回音頻率」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Impact-echo frequency” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：敲擊回音厚度頻率 f = β·C_p/(2T)。腹板厚 T = 0.30 m、C_p = 4,000 m/s、β = 0.96：f = 0.96×4,000/0.60 = 6,400 Hz；若孔道深 0.15 m 處有空洞，反射面變為 0.15 m，頻率峰值移到 0.96×4,000/0.30 = 12,800 Hz。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Impact-echo thickness frequency f = β·C_p/(2T). For a 0.30 m web with C_p = 4,000 m/s and β = 0.96, f = 0.96×4,000/0.60 = 6,400 Hz; a void at a duct 0.15 m deep moves the reflecting surface to 0.15 m and the peak to 0.96×4,000/0.30 = 12,800 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先以透地雷達標出鋼腱位置，再沿鋼腱以固定間距做敲擊回音或超音波掃描，把疑似空洞標在圖上；選取代表性位置鑽孔以內視鏡確認，並以已知良好與已知空洞的位置校正判讀門檻，所有鑽孔事後以相容材料密封。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Locate tendons first with ground-penetrating radar, then scan along them at fixed spacing by impact-echo or ultrasonics and map suspected voids; drill representative locations for borescope confirmation, calibrate interpretation thresholds against known-good and known-void spots, and seal every hole afterwards with compatible material.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"敲擊回音厚度頻率 f = β·C_p/(2T)。腹板厚 T = 0.30 m、C_p = 4,000 m/s、β = 0.96：f = 0.96×4,000/0.60 = 6,400 Hz；若孔道深 0.15 m 處有空洞，反射面變為 0.15 m，頻率峰值移到 0.96×4,000/0.30 = 12,800 Hz。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Impact-echo thickness frequency f = β·C_p/(2T). For a 0.30 m web with C_p = 4,000 m/s and β = 0.96, f = 0.96×4,000/0.60 = 6,400 Hz; a void at a duct 0.15 m deep moves the reflecting surface to 0.15 m and the peak to 0.96×4,000/0.30 = 12,800 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection\", which statement holds?","options":["敲擊回音厚度頻率 f = β·C_p/(2T)。","鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。","加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Impact-echo thickness frequency f = β·C_p/(2T).","Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust.","Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons."],"answer":0,"explanation":"敲擊回音厚度頻率 f = β·C_p/(2T)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Impact-echo thickness frequency f = β·C_p/(2T). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b054-v13-31","title":"空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「敲擊回音頻率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Impact-echo frequency” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先以透地雷達標出鋼腱位置，再沿鋼腱以固定間距做敲擊回音或超音波掃描，把疑似空洞標在圖上；選取代表性位置鑽孔以內視鏡確認，並以已知良好與已知空洞的位置校正判讀門檻，所有鑽孔事後以相容材料密封。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Locate tendons first with ground-penetrating radar, then scan along them at fixed spacing by impact-echo or ultrasonics and map suspected voids; drill representative locations for borescope confirmation, calibrate interpretation thresholds against known-good and known-void spots, and seal every hole afterwards with compatible material. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：檢測計畫要說明採用的方法組合、掃描間距、判讀門檻與校正方式，並以風險高低決定鑽孔位置與數量；鑽孔、取樣與封孔程序由設計者核准，結果與鋼腱編號一同存檔。","observationEn":"Site practice: The inspection plan states the combination of methods, scan spacing, interpretation thresholds and calibration, choosing drilling locations and numbers by risk; drilling, sampling and sealing procedures are approved by the designer, and results are archived against tendon numbers.","failure":"注意干擾：只依單一非破壞方法的結果就判定「無空洞」，忽略鋼絞線束與鋼筋造成的訊號干擾；或大量鑽孔取樣後未確實封孔，反而為水與氯離子打開新通道，加速原本完好鋼腱的腐蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Declaring no voids from a single non-destructive method ignores interference from strand bundles and reinforcement; drilling many sample holes without proper sealing opens new paths for water and chloride, accelerating corrosion of tendons that were sound. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先以透地雷達標出鋼腱位置，再沿鋼腱以固定間距做敲擊回音或超音波掃描，把疑似空洞標在圖上；選取代表性位置鑽孔以內視鏡確認，並以已知良好與已知空洞的位置校正判讀門檻，所有鑽孔事後以相容材料密封。","textEn":"Locate tendons first with ground-penetrating radar, then scan along them at fixed spacing by impact-echo or ultrasonics and map suspected voids; drill representative locations for borescope confirmation, calibrate interpretation thresholds against known-good and known-void spots, and seal every hole afterwards with compatible material.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"檢測計畫要說明採用的方法組合、掃描間距、判讀門檻與校正方式，並以風險高低決定鑽孔位置與數量；鑽孔、取樣與封孔程序由設計者核准，結果與鋼腱編號一同存檔。","textEn":"The inspection plan states the combination of methods, scan spacing, interpretation thresholds and calibration, choosing drilling locations and numbers by risk; drilling, sampling and sealing procedures are approved by the designer, and results are archived against tendon numbers.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","先以透地雷達標出鋼腱位置，再沿鋼腱以固定間距做敲擊回音或超音波掃描，把疑似空洞標在圖上。","灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Locate tendons first with ground-penetrating radar, then scan along them at fixed spacing by impact-echo or ultrasonics and map suspected voids.","The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先以透地雷達標出鋼腱位置，再沿鋼腱以固定間距做敲擊回音或超音波掃描，把疑似空洞標在圖上；選取代表性位置鑽孔以內視鏡確認，並以已知良好與已知空洞的位置校正判讀門檻，所有鑽孔事後以相容材料密封。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Locate tendons first with ground-penetrating radar, then scan along them at fixed spacing by impact-echo or ultrasonics and map suspected voids; drill representative locations for borescope confirmation, calibrate interpretation thresholds against known-good and known-void spots, and seal every hole afterwards with compatible material. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b054-v13-32","title":"空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「敲擊回音頻率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Impact-echo frequency” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只依單一非破壞方法的結果就判定「無空洞」，忽略鋼絞線束與鋼筋造成的訊號干擾；或大量鑽孔取樣後未確實封孔，反而為水與氯離子打開新通道，加速原本完好鋼腱的腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Declaring no voids from a single non-destructive method ignores interference from strand bundles and reinforcement; drilling many sample holes without proper sealing opens new paths for water and chloride, accelerating corrosion of tendons that were sound. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：FHWA 2013 年的指引提醒，侵入式檢測本身會製造腐蝕通道，取樣數量應盡量少並確實修復。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: FHWA's 2013 guidance warns that invasive testing itself creates corrosion paths, so the number of samples should be minimised and every hole properly repaired.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「非破壞檢測可以百分之百找出孔道內的所有空洞。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Non-destructive testing can find every void in a duct with certainty.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只依單一非破壞方法的結果就判定「無空洞」，忽略鋼絞線束與鋼筋造成的訊號干擾；或大量鑽孔取樣後未確實封孔，反而為水與氯離子打開新通道，加速原本完好鋼腱的腐蝕。","textEn":"Declaring no voids from a single non-destructive method ignores interference from strand bundles and reinforcement; drilling many sample holes without proper sealing opens new paths for water and chloride, accelerating corrosion of tendons that were sound.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「空洞的非破壞與局部破壞檢測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Non-destructive and minimally invasive void detection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。","只依單一非破壞方法的結果就判定「無空洞」，忽略鋼絞線束與鋼筋造成的訊號干擾；或大量鑽孔取樣後未確實封孔，反而為水與氯離子打開新通道，加速原本完好鋼腱的腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.","Declaring no voids from a single non-destructive method ignores interference from strand bundles and reinforcement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只依單一非破壞方法的結果就判定「無空洞」，忽略鋼絞線束與鋼筋造成的訊號干擾；或大量鑽孔取樣後未確實封孔，反而為水與氯離子打開新通道，加速原本完好鋼腱的腐蝕。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Declaring no voids from a single non-destructive method ignores interference from strand bundles and reinforcement; drilling many sample holes without proper sealing opens new paths for water and chloride, accelerating corrosion of tendons that were sound. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b054-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化」與「灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Long-term deterioration in defective grout\" and \"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b054-v13-33","title":"缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Long-term deterioration in defective grout: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pit depth and wire section” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕通常是慢性的：空洞中的潮濕空氣、泌水留下的水分、離析後柔軟且鹼性不足的灌漿，以及氯離子或硫酸鹽，都會讓鋼絞線局部去鈍化並形成蝕坑。蝕坑比均勻腐蝕危險，因為鋼絲在蝕坑處應力集中、斷面驟減，在仍有高預力的情況下可能突然斷裂。外部來源同樣重要：倫敦漢默史密斯高架橋在 2011 年因除冰鹽造成鋼腱腐蝕而緊急處理，後來以外置預力補強，2015 年完成修復。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Corrosion from grout defects is usually chronic: damp air in voids, water left by bleed, segregated grout that is soft and less alkaline, and chlorides or sulfates depassivate strands locally and form pits. Pitting is more dangerous than uniform corrosion, because stress concentrates and the section drops sharply at the pit while the wire still carries high prestress, so it can snap suddenly. External sources matter too: London's Hammersmith Flyover required emergency action in 2011 when de-icing salts corroded its tendons, and was later strengthened with external post-tensioning, with repairs completed in 2015. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pit depth and wire section” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：腐蝕電流 1 μA/cm² 約相當於 11.6 μm/年。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A corrosion current of 1 μA/cm² corresponds to about 11.6 μm per year.","failure":"常見誤解：「使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pit depth and wire section”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-33-k1","title":"缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化","titleEn":"Long-term deterioration in defective grout","text":"灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕通常是慢性的：空洞中的潮濕空氣、泌水留下的水分、離析後柔軟且鹼性不足的灌漿，以及氯離子或硫酸鹽，都會讓鋼絞線局部去鈍化並形成蝕坑。蝕坑比均勻腐蝕危險，因為鋼絲在蝕坑處應力集中、斷面驟減，在仍有高預力的情況下可能突然斷裂。","textEn":"Corrosion from grout defects is usually chronic: damp air in voids, water left by bleed, segregated grout that is soft and less alkaline, and chlorides or sulfates depassivate strands locally and form pits. Pitting is more dangerous than uniform corrosion, because stress concentrates and the section drops sharply at the pit while the wire still carries high prestress, so it can snap suddenly.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Long-term deterioration in defective grout\" is correct?","options":["灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕通常是慢性的：空洞中的潮濕空氣、泌水留下的水分、離析後柔軟且鹼性不足的灌漿，以及氯離子或硫酸鹽，都會讓鋼絞線局部去鈍化並形成蝕坑。","使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。","灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。"],"optionsEn":["Corrosion from grout defects is usually chronic: damp air in voids, water left by bleed, segregated grout that is soft and less alkaline, and chlorides or sulfates depassivate strands locally and form pits.","New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.","Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept."],"answer":0,"explanation":"灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕通常是慢性的：空洞中的潮濕空氣、泌水留下的水分、離析後柔軟且鹼性不足的灌漿，以及氯離子或硫酸鹽，都會讓鋼絞線局部去鈍化並形成蝕坑。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Corrosion from grout defects is usually chronic: damp air in voids, water left by bleed, segregated grout that is soft and less alkaline, and chlorides or sulfates depassivate strands locally and form pits. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b054-v13-34","title":"缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化：定量估算","titleEn":"Long-term deterioration in defective grout: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pit depth and wire section” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：腐蝕電流 1 μA/cm² 約相當於 11.6 μm/年。直徑 5 mm 鋼絲（半徑 2.5 mm）均勻腐蝕 20 年，半徑損失 0.23 mm，剩餘面積 (2.268/2.5)² ≈ 82%；若蝕坑係數 5，局部蝕坑深度約 1.16 mm，接近半徑的一半。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A corrosion current of 1 μA/cm² corresponds to about 11.6 μm per year. A 5 mm wire (2.5 mm radius) corroding uniformly for 20 years loses 0.23 mm of radius, leaving (2.268/2.5)² ≈ 82% of its area; with a pitting factor of 5, the local pit is about 1.16 mm deep, nearly half the radius. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：取出的灌漿樣本檢驗酸溶性氯離子（以水泥重量 0.08% 為門檻）、硫酸鹽與含水狀態，觀察灌漿是否柔軟、分層或變色；暴露的鋼絞線記錄蝕坑深度與斷絲數；必要時以磁漏或其他方法評估鋼腱內部斷絲，並以結構分析檢查剩餘預力的安全性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Test extracted grout for acid-soluble chloride against the 0.08% by cement weight threshold, for sulfate and for moisture, and look for soft, layered or discoloured grout; record pit depths and broken wires on exposed strands; where needed assess internal wire breaks by magnetic flux leakage or other methods, and check the safety of the remaining prestress by analysis.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"腐蝕電流 1 μA/cm² 約相當於 11.6 μm/年。直徑 5 mm 鋼絲（半徑 2.5 mm）均勻腐蝕 20 年，半徑損失 0.23 mm，剩餘面積 (2.268/2.5)² ≈ 82%；若蝕坑係數 5，局部蝕坑深度約 1.16 mm，接近半徑的一半。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A corrosion current of 1 μA/cm² corresponds to about 11.6 μm per year. A 5 mm wire (2.5 mm radius) corroding uniformly for 20 years loses 0.23 mm of radius, leaving (2.268/2.5)² ≈ 82% of its area; with a pitting factor of 5, the local pit is about 1.16 mm deep, nearly half the radius. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Long-term deterioration in defective grout\", which statement holds?","options":["灌漿從一端打入、另一端出漿，就代表孔道已經完全填滿。","腐蝕電流 1 μA/cm² 約相當於 11.6 μm/年。","孔道只是預留的通道，用什麼材料、接頭是否密封都不重要。"],"optionsEn":["If grout pumped in at one end comes out at the other, the duct is completely filled.","A corrosion current of 1 μA/cm² corresponds to about 11.6 μm per year.","A duct is just a preformed hole, so its material and joint sealing do not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"腐蝕電流 1 μA/cm² 約相當於 11.6 μm/年。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A corrosion current of 1 μA/cm² corresponds to about 11.6 μm per year. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b054-v13-35","title":"缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Long-term deterioration in defective grout: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pit depth and wire section” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"取出的灌漿樣本檢驗酸溶性氯離子（以水泥重量 0.08% 為門檻）、硫酸鹽與含水狀態，觀察灌漿是否柔軟、分層或變色；暴露的鋼絞線記錄蝕坑深度與斷絲數；必要時以磁漏或其他方法評估鋼腱內部斷絲，並以結構分析檢查剩餘預力的安全性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Test extracted grout for acid-soluble chloride against the 0.08% by cement weight threshold, for sulfate and for moisture, and look for soft, layered or discoloured grout; record pit depths and broken wires on exposed strands; where needed assess internal wire breaks by magnetic flux leakage or other methods, and check the safety of the remaining prestress by analysis. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：管理單位應依建造年代、材料與施工紀錄建立後拉橋梁清單，優先檢查錨頭、節塊接縫與高點；發現腐蝕時由結構工程師評估剩餘預力並決定監測、補灌、外置預力補強或鋼腱更換。","observationEn":"Site practice: Owners should inventory post-tensioned bridges by age, materials and construction records, prioritising anchorages, segment joints and crests; where corrosion is found, a structural engineer assesses remaining prestress and decides on monitoring, regrouting, external post-tensioning or tendon replacement.","failure":"注意干擾：FHWA 調查指出，美國有 10 個州回報過與灌漿缺陷或過量氯離子有關的鋼腱問題，部分是 2001 年後採用預拌灌漿的新橋；若只把問題視為舊橋專屬，新橋的離析或高硫酸鹽灌漿就會被忽略，直到斷絲才被發現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: FHWA reported that 10 states had tendon problems linked to grout deficiencies or excess chloride, some on newer bridges built with pre-bagged grouts after 2001; treating the problem as confined to old bridges lets segregated or high-sulfate grout in new bridges go unnoticed until wires break. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"取出的灌漿樣本檢驗酸溶性氯離子（以水泥重量 0.08% 為門檻）、硫酸鹽與含水狀態，觀察灌漿是否柔軟、分層或變色；暴露的鋼絞線記錄蝕坑深度與斷絲數；必要時以磁漏或其他方法評估鋼腱內部斷絲，並以結構分析檢查剩餘預力的安全性。","textEn":"Test extracted grout for acid-soluble chloride against the 0.08% by cement weight threshold, for sulfate and for moisture, and look for soft, layered or discoloured grout; record pit depths and broken wires on exposed strands; where needed assess internal wire breaks by magnetic flux leakage or other methods, and check the safety of the remaining prestress by analysis.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"管理單位應依建造年代、材料與施工紀錄建立後拉橋梁清單，優先檢查錨頭、節塊接縫與高點；發現腐蝕時由結構工程師評估剩餘預力並決定監測、補灌、外置預力補強或鋼腱更換。","textEn":"Owners should inventory post-tensioned bridges by age, materials and construction records, prioritising anchorages, segment joints and crests; where corrosion is found, a structural engineer assesses remaining prestress and decides on monitoring, regrouting, external post-tensioning or tendon replacement.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Long-term deterioration in defective grout\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","灌漿當天出漿正常，之後就不可能在高點或錨頭出現空洞。","取出的灌漿樣本檢驗酸溶性氯離子（以水泥重量 0.08% 為門檻）、硫酸鹽與含水狀態，觀察灌漿是否柔軟、分層或變色。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","If grout flowed properly on grouting day, voids cannot later appear at crests or anchorages.","Test extracted grout for acid-soluble chloride against the 0.08% by cement weight threshold, for sulfate and for moisture, and look for soft, layered or discoloured grout."],"answer":2,"explanation":"取出的灌漿樣本檢驗酸溶性氯離子（以水泥重量 0.08% 為門檻）、硫酸鹽與含水狀態，觀察灌漿是否柔軟、分層或變色；暴露的鋼絞線記錄蝕坑深度與斷絲數；必要時以磁漏或其他方法評估鋼腱內部斷絲，並以結構分析檢查剩餘預力的安全性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Test extracted grout for acid-soluble chloride against the 0.08% by cement weight threshold, for sulfate and for moisture, and look for soft, layered or discoloured grout; record pit depths and broken wires on exposed strands; where needed assess internal wire breaks by magnetic flux leakage or other methods, and check the safety of the remaining prestress by analysis. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b054-v13-36","title":"缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Long-term deterioration in defective grout: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「蝕坑深度與鋼絲斷面」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pit depth and wire section” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"FHWA 調查指出，美國有 10 個州回報過與灌漿缺陷或過量氯離子有關的鋼腱問題，部分是 2001 年後採用預拌灌漿的新橋；若只把問題視為舊橋專屬，新橋的離析或高硫酸鹽灌漿就會被忽略，直到斷絲才被發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"FHWA reported that 10 states had tendon problems linked to grout deficiencies or excess chloride, some on newer bridges built with pre-bagged grouts after 2001; treating the problem as confined to old bridges lets segregated or high-sulfate grout in new bridges go unnoticed until wires break. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：外部來源同樣重要：倫敦漢默史密斯高架橋在 2011 年因除冰鹽造成鋼腱腐蝕而緊急處理，後來以外置預力補強，2015 年完成修復。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: External sources matter too: London's Hammersmith Flyover required emergency action in 2011 when de-icing salts corroded its tendons, and was later strengthened with external post-tensioning, with repairs completed in 2015.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「使用預拌包裝灌漿的新橋，就不會有灌漿缺陷造成的腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"New bridges using pre-bagged grout cannot suffer corrosion from grout defects.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"FHWA 調查指出，美國有 10 個州回報過與灌漿缺陷或過量氯離子有關的鋼腱問題，部分是 2001 年後採用預拌灌漿的新橋；若只把問題視為舊橋專屬，新橋的離析或高硫酸鹽灌漿就會被忽略，直到斷絲才被發現。","textEn":"FHWA reported that 10 states had tendon problems linked to grout deficiencies or excess chloride, some on newer bridges built with pre-bagged grouts after 2001; treating the problem as confined to old bridges lets segregated or high-sulfate grout in new bridges go unnoticed until wires break.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「缺陷灌漿中的長期劣化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Long-term deterioration in defective grout\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["FHWA 調查指出，美國有 10 個州回報過與灌漿缺陷或過量氯離子有關的鋼腱問題，部分是 2001 年後採用預拌灌漿的新橋。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。"],"optionsEn":["FHWA reported that 10 states had tendon problems linked to grout deficiencies or excess chloride, some on newer bridges built with pre-bagged grouts after 2001.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept."],"answer":0,"explanation":"FHWA 調查指出，美國有 10 個州回報過與灌漿缺陷或過量氯離子有關的鋼腱問題，部分是 2001 年後採用預拌灌漿的新橋；若只把問題視為舊橋專屬，新橋的離析或高硫酸鹽灌漿就會被忽略，直到斷絲才被發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"FHWA reported that 10 states had tendon problems linked to grout deficiencies or excess chloride, some on newer bridges built with pre-bagged grouts after 2001; treating the problem as confined to old bridges lets segregated or high-sulfate grout in new bridges go unnoticed until wires break. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b054-v13-37","title":"灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」如何影響預力混凝土孔道灌漿的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Grout reconciliation and risk score” governs force, deformation or durability in “Prestressing-duct grouting”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿缺陷無法在完工後直接看到，因此施工紀錄是日後判斷風險的主要依據：每條鋼腱的材料批號、試驗結果、灌注量、壓力歷程與排氣順序都要保存。FHWA 2013 年的指引把風險定義為缺陷機率指標乘以破壞後果指標，各以 1 到 5 分評估，沒有紀錄的工程被直接給予最高的機率分數。英國在 1985 年 Ynys-y-Gwas 崩塌後，1992 年暫停新建內部灌漿後拉橋並進行五年檢查，1996 年才解除，說明紀錄、檢查與可更換設計對業主決策的重要性。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Grout defects cannot be seen after completion, so construction records are the main basis for later risk judgements: each tendon's material lots, test results, injected volume, pressure history and venting sequence must be kept. FHWA's 2013 guidance defines risk as a probability-of-defect indicator times a consequence-of-failure indicator, each scored 1 to 5, and projects with no records are given the highest probability score outright. After the Ynys-y-Gwas collapse of 1985, Britain halted new internally grouted post-tensioned bridges in 1992 for a five-year inspection programme and lifted the moratorium only in 1996, showing how records, inspection and replaceable design shape owners' decisions. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Grout reconciliation and risk score” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：灌漿量對帳：理論淨灌漿 0.52 m³，扣除出口廢棄量後實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 0.03 m³ = 30 L，相當於 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m 孔道的淨體積，應列為疑似空洞追查。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Grout reconciliation: the theoretical net volume is 0.52 m³ and 0.49 m³ went in after outlet waste, a shortfall of 0.03 m³ = 30 L, the net volume of about 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m of duct, to be followed up as a suspected void.","failure":"常見誤解：「灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Grout reconciliation and risk score”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-37-k1","title":"灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接","titleEn":"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover","text":"灌漿缺陷無法在完工後直接看到，因此施工紀錄是日後判斷風險的主要依據：每條鋼腱的材料批號、試驗結果、灌注量、壓力歷程與排氣順序都要保存。FHWA 2013 年的指引把風險定義為缺陷機率指標乘以破壞後果指標，各以 1 到 5 分評估，沒有紀錄的工程被直接給予最高的機率分數。","textEn":"Grout defects cannot be seen after completion, so construction records are the main basis for later risk judgements: each tendon's material lots, test results, injected volume, pressure history and venting sequence must be kept. FHWA's 2013 guidance defines risk as a probability-of-defect indicator times a consequence-of-failure indicator, each scored 1 to 5, and projects with no records are given the highest probability score outright.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover\" is correct?","options":["灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。","灌漿缺陷無法在完工後直接看到，因此施工紀錄是日後判斷風險的主要依據：每條鋼腱的材料批號、試驗結果、灌注量、壓力歷程與排氣順序都要保存。","鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。"],"optionsEn":["Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept.","Grout defects cannot be seen after completion, so construction records are the main basis for later risk judgements: each tendon's material lots, test results, injected volume, pressure history and venting sequence must be kept.","Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust."],"answer":1,"explanation":"灌漿缺陷無法在完工後直接看到，因此施工紀錄是日後判斷風險的主要依據：每條鋼腱的材料批號、試驗結果、灌注量、壓力歷程與排氣順序都要保存。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Grout defects cannot be seen after completion, so construction records are the main basis for later risk judgements: each tendon's material lots, test results, injected volume, pressure history and venting sequence must be kept. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b054-v13-38","title":"灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Grout reconciliation and risk score” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：灌漿量對帳：理論淨灌漿 0.52 m³，扣除出口廢棄量後實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 0.03 m³ = 30 L，相當於 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m 孔道的淨體積，應列為疑似空洞追查。風險分數 = 機率 × 後果：無紀錄 5 × 主要幹線 4 = 20（滿分 25），優先檢查。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Grout reconciliation: the theoretical net volume is 0.52 m³ and 0.49 m³ went in after outlet waste, a shortfall of 0.03 m³ = 30 L, the net volume of about 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m of duct, to be followed up as a suspected void. Risk score = probability × consequence: no records 5 × major route 4 = 20 out of 25, a priority for inspection. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：交接前逐條核對灌漿紀錄的完整性（材料批號、試驗、壓力、排氣、灌注量與理論量對帳、空洞檢查與補灌），缺漏者補做檢測；把風險評分方法與結果寫入維護計畫，並訂定錨頭與高點的定期檢查週期。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before handover check every tendon's grouting record for completeness (lots, tests, pressures, venting, injected versus theoretical volume, void checks and regrouting), testing where records are missing; write the risk-scoring method and results into the maintenance plan with set inspection intervals for anchorages and crests.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"灌漿量對帳：理論淨灌漿 0.52 m³，扣除出口廢棄量後實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 0.03 m³ = 30 L，相當於 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m 孔道的淨體積，應列為疑似空洞追查。風險分數 = 機率 × 後果：無紀錄 5 × 主要幹線 4 = 20（滿分 25），優先檢查。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Grout reconciliation: the theoretical net volume is 0.52 m³ and 0.49 m³ went in after outlet waste, a shortfall of 0.03 m³ = 30 L, the net volume of about 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m of duct, to be followed up as a suspected void. Risk score = probability × consequence: no records 5 × major route 4 = 20 out of 25, a priority for inspection. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover\", which statement holds?","options":["加一點早強劑或其他添加劑讓灌漿更快硬化，對鋼腱沒有影響。","灌漿壓力越高越好，可以把孔道擠得更密實。","灌漿量對帳：理論淨灌漿 0.52 m³，扣除出口廢棄量後實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 0.03 m³ = 30 L，相當於 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m 孔道的淨體積，應列為疑似空洞追查。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a little accelerator or another admixture to speed grout hardening does not affect the tendons.","The higher the grouting pressure the better, because it packs the duct more densely.","Grout reconciliation: the theoretical net volume is 0.52 m³ and 0.49 m³ went in after outlet waste, a shortfall of 0.03 m³ = 30 L, the net volume of about 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m of duct, to be followed up as a suspected void."],"answer":2,"explanation":"灌漿量對帳：理論淨灌漿 0.52 m³，扣除出口廢棄量後實際灌入 0.49 m³，短少 0.03 m³ = 30 L，相當於 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m 孔道的淨體積，應列為疑似空洞追查。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Grout reconciliation: the theoretical net volume is 0.52 m³ and 0.49 m³ went in after outlet waste, a shortfall of 0.03 m³ = 30 L, the net volume of about 30/5.19 ≈ 5.8 m of duct, to be followed up as a suspected void. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b054-v13-39","title":"灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Grout reconciliation and risk score” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"交接前逐條核對灌漿紀錄的完整性（材料批號、試驗、壓力、排氣、灌注量與理論量對帳、空洞檢查與補灌），缺漏者補做檢測；把風險評分方法與結果寫入維護計畫，並訂定錨頭與高點的定期檢查週期。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before handover check every tendon's grouting record for completeness (lots, tests, pressures, venting, injected versus theoretical volume, void checks and regrouting), testing where records are missing; write the risk-scoring method and results into the maintenance plan with set inspection intervals for anchorages and crests. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包含鋼腱與排氣口配置竣工圖、每條鋼腱的灌漿紀錄與對帳、材料與試驗報告、空洞檢查與補灌紀錄、錨頭防護細部、風險評分與檢查週期；新設計優先考慮可檢查、可更換的鋼腱配置，並由業主指定的工程師核定。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover includes as-built tendon and vent layouts, each tendon's grouting record and reconciliation, material and test reports, void-check and regrout records, anchorage-protection details, risk scores and inspection intervals; new designs favour inspectable, replaceable tendon layouts, approved by the owner's designated engineer.","failure":"注意干擾：灌漿紀錄只寫「完成」而沒有灌注量與壓力資料，多年後發現某條鋼腱斷絲時，無法判斷是個案還是系統性問題，只能大範圍鑽孔檢查，既昂貴又增加新的腐蝕通道。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Records that say only completed, with no volumes or pressures, mean that when a tendon is later found with broken wires no one can tell whether it is isolated or systemic, forcing widespread drilling that is costly and opens new corrosion paths. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"交接前逐條核對灌漿紀錄的完整性（材料批號、試驗、壓力、排氣、灌注量與理論量對帳、空洞檢查與補灌），缺漏者補做檢測；把風險評分方法與結果寫入維護計畫，並訂定錨頭與高點的定期檢查週期。","textEn":"Before handover check every tendon's grouting record for completeness (lots, tests, pressures, venting, injected versus theoretical volume, void checks and regrouting), testing where records are missing; write the risk-scoring method and results into the maintenance plan with set inspection intervals for anchorages and crests.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包含鋼腱與排氣口配置竣工圖、每條鋼腱的灌漿紀錄與對帳、材料與試驗報告、空洞檢查與補灌紀錄、錨頭防護細部、風險評分與檢查週期；新設計優先考慮可檢查、可更換的鋼腱配置，並由業主指定的工程師核定。","textEn":"Handover includes as-built tendon and vent layouts, each tendon's grouting record and reconciliation, material and test reports, void-check and regrout records, anchorage-protection details, risk scores and inspection intervals; new designs favour inspectable, replaceable tendon layouts, approved by the owner's designated engineer.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover\"?","options":["交接前逐條核對灌漿紀錄的完整性（材料批號、試驗、壓力、排氣、灌注量與理論量對帳、空洞檢查與補灌），缺漏者補做檢測。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","灌漿越稀越容易流進孔道，品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["Before handover check every tendon's grouting record for completeness (lots, tests, pressures, venting, injected versus theoretical volume, void checks and regrouting), testing where records are missing.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The thinner the grout, the more easily it fills the duct and the better the quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"交接前逐條核對灌漿紀錄的完整性（材料批號、試驗、壓力、排氣、灌注量與理論量對帳、空洞檢查與補灌），缺漏者補做檢測；把風險評分方法與結果寫入維護計畫，並訂定錨頭與高點的定期檢查週期。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before handover check every tendon's grouting record for completeness (lots, tests, pressures, venting, injected versus theoretical volume, void checks and regrouting), testing where records are missing; write the risk-scoring method and results into the maintenance plan with set inspection intervals for anchorages and crests. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b054-v13-40","title":"灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"prerequisiteIds":["b054-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「灌漿量對帳與風險分數」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Grout reconciliation and risk score” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"灌漿紀錄只寫「完成」而沒有灌注量與壓力資料，多年後發現某條鋼腱斷絲時，無法判斷是個案還是系統性問題，只能大範圍鑽孔檢查，既昂貴又增加新的腐蝕通道。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Records that say only completed, with no volumes or pressures, mean that when a tendon is later found with broken wires no one can tell whether it is isolated or systemic, forcing widespread drilling that is costly and opens new corrosion paths. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：英國在 1985 年 Ynys-y-Gwas 崩塌後，1992 年暫停新建內部灌漿後拉橋並進行五年檢查，1996 年才解除，說明紀錄、檢查與可更換設計對業主決策的重要性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: After the Ynys-y-Gwas collapse of 1985, Britain halted new internally grouted post-tensioned bridges in 1992 for a five-year inspection programme and lifted the moratorium only in 1996, showing how records, inspection and replaceable design shape owners' decisions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌漿完成後紀錄就沒有用處，不需要長期保存。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once grouting is done the records are useless and need not be kept.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b054-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"灌漿紀錄只寫「完成」而沒有灌注量與壓力資料，多年後發現某條鋼腱斷絲時，無法判斷是個案還是系統性問題，只能大範圍鑽孔檢查，既昂貴又增加新的腐蝕通道。","textEn":"Records that say only completed, with no volumes or pressures, mean that when a tendon is later found with broken wires no one can tell whether it is isolated or systemic, forcing widespread drilling that is costly and opens new corrosion paths.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]},{"id":"b054-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿紀錄、風險分級與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Grouting records, risk ranking and engineering handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","灌漿紀錄只寫「完成」而沒有灌注量與壓力資料，多年後發現某條鋼腱斷絲時，無法判斷是個案還是系統性問題，只能大範圍鑽孔檢查，既昂貴又增加新的腐蝕通道。","鋼腱被包在混凝土裡面，自然就不會生鏽。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Records that say only completed, with no volumes or pressures, mean that when a tendon is later found with broken wires no one can tell whether it is isolated or systemic, forcing widespread drilling that is costly and opens new corrosion paths.","Tendons buried inside concrete cannot rust."],"answer":1,"explanation":"灌漿紀錄只寫「完成」而沒有灌注量與壓力資料，多年後發現某條鋼腱斷絲時，無法判斷是個案還是系統性問題，只能大範圍鑽孔檢查，既昂貴又增加新的腐蝕通道。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Records that say only completed, with no volumes or pressures, mean that when a tendon is later found with broken wires no one can tell whether it is isolated or systemic, forcing widespread drilling that is costly and opens new corrosion paths. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-pti-home","v13s-wiki-post-tensioned-concrete"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
